(3045293, 428374, 52130, '<td valign="top">wow, I really like this. I felt like I was almost teetering in my seat because the angle it was taken at, that''s a loely flower and vase to match and the writing is very subtle. The only thing I wish you would have gotten rid of was that crumb or whatever that is next to the vase''s base. 9</td>', 'wow, I really like this. I felt like I was almost teetering in my seat because the angle it was taken at, that''s a loely flower and vase to match and the writing is very subtle. The only thing I wish you would have gotten rid of was that crumb or whatever that is next to the vase''s base. 9', '2006-11-20 00:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
