(3045608, 428893, 65025, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection of the light off of the water.  I would have like to see a little less sky and a little more beach.  Also I would like to see the sun on the right third...a little less close to the middle.  It could have added a bit more of a leading line from the water on the left to the sun.  7</td>', 'I love the reflection of the light off of the water.  I would have like to see a little less sky and a little more beach.  Also I would like to see the sun on the right third...a little less close to the middle.  It could have added a bit more of a leading line from the water on the left to the sun.  7', '2006-11-20 01:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045612, 429147, 65025, '<td valign="top">Very nice feel to it.  I love the light rays on the top.</td>', 'Very nice feel to it.  I love the light rays on the top.', '2006-11-20 01:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045617, 429091, 65025, '<td valign="top">He he...I like it, because there is a market for a postcard with this caption!  You''re probably getting some SH#T for it, huh.  I know many friends who would by it just for the caption.  I could actually picture many of my friends sending me this photo, and me laughing my ass off when I got it.  <br/> <br/>Oh, P.S. also a VERY lovely photo as well.  8</td>', 'He he...I like it, because there is a market for a postcard with this caption!  You''re probably getting some SH#T for it, huh.  I know many friends who would by it just for the caption.  I could actually picture many of my friends sending me this photo, and me laughing my ass off when I got it.   Oh, P.S. also a VERY lovely photo as well.  8', '2006-11-20 01:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045620, 427936, 65025, '<td valign="top">I really like the repetition of the canons. You captured a nice rhythm with your angle.  Also, the text fits well.  Though I would like a bit more size difference.  Maybe make the top text smaller, or the bottom a bit larger?</td>', 'I really like the repetition of the canons. You captured a nice rhythm with your angle.  Also, the text fits well.  Though I would like a bit more size difference.  Maybe make the top text smaller, or the bottom a bit larger?', '2006-11-20 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045623, 429116, 65025, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection.  I might clone out the bottom left black part...it''s a bit distracting, but pretty minor.</td>', 'Lovely reflection.  I might clone out the bottom left black part...it''s a bit distracting, but pretty minor.', '2006-11-20 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045625, 427774, 65025, '<td valign="top">The title...doesn''t that mean "a whale''s vagina?"  Just kidding...I REALLY hope you''ve seen the movie Anchorman, or you''ll probably think I''m a freak...hehe.  Very nice reflection and over all capture.</td>', 'The title...doesn''t that mean "a whale''s vagina?"  Just kidding...I REALLY hope you''ve seen the movie Anchorman, or you''ll probably think I''m a freak...hehe.  Very nice reflection and over all capture.', '2006-11-20 01:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045626, 429434, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the title! Good composition from an excellent vantage point. I also like the exposure - very, very nice.</td>', 'Love the title! Good composition from an excellent vantage point. I also like the exposure - very, very nice.', '2006-11-20 01:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045629, 428398, 65025, '<td valign="top">He he.  It''s a nice contrast of the modern pop culture stuff vs. the old elegance.</td>', 'He he.  It''s a nice contrast of the modern pop culture stuff vs. the old elegance.', '2006-11-20 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045631, 428955, 45194, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Tri-cities...I wish I could have caught a morning like that down here this week!</td>', 'Hello from the Tri-cities...I wish I could have caught a morning like that down here this week!', '2006-11-20 01:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045632, 429124, 65025, '<td valign="top">The overexposed parts look really nice...like snow caps or glaciers or something...very cool.  The one thing I think that could be improved is the NC text on the bottom.  It looks a bit stretched too much.</td>', 'The overexposed parts look really nice...like snow caps or glaciers or something...very cool.  The one thing I think that could be improved is the NC text on the bottom.  It looks a bit stretched too much.', '2006-11-20 01:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045636, 428840, 65025, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard for a haunted house or something!  Cool!  A bit creepy....but cool!</td>', 'Looks like a postcard for a haunted house or something!  Cool!  A bit creepy....but cool!', '2006-11-20 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045637, 427805, 50641, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the splash of trees in the front.  Might be cool to darken those clouds, make them more ominous and moody.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the splash of trees in the front.  Might be cool to darken those clouds, make them more ominous and moody.', '2006-11-20 01:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045638, 428547, 50641, '<td valign="top">Love the fun.  Wish you luck ;-)</td>', 'Love the fun.  Wish you luck ;-)', '2006-11-20 01:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045639, 427818, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2006-11-20 01:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045640, 427320, 65025, '<td valign="top">I love the detail and color in the turtle, and how it contrasts to everything else.</td>', 'I love the detail and color in the turtle, and how it contrasts to everything else.', '2006-11-20 01:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045644, 427685, 50641, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but my goodness, what''s sticking out of his bum?</td>', 'Lovely, but my goodness, what''s sticking out of his bum?', '2006-11-20 01:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045649, 428303, 65025, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy.</td>', 'A bit grainy.', '2006-11-20 01:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045651, 429185, 36065, '<td valign="top">Creative with nice lighting, but it really isn''t what I had in mind for the challenge.</td>', 'Creative with nice lighting, but it really isn''t what I had in mind for the challenge.', '2006-11-20 01:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045652, 427514, 36065, '<td valign="top">I see some color banding in the clouds, almost as if this one is over saturated.  I do like the subject and composition, but it looks like your post-processing detracts from the end product.</td>', 'I see some color banding in the clouds, almost as if this one is over saturated.  I do like the subject and composition, but it looks like your post-processing detracts from the end product.', '2006-11-20 01:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045655, 429409, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice vintage color processing. Very good comp.</td>', 'Nice vintage color processing. Very good comp.', '2006-11-20 01:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045656, 429337, 65025, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept, but it''s almost impossible to read the text.</td>', 'I understand the concept, but it''s almost impossible to read the text.', '2006-11-20 01:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045658, 427053, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but this one your subjects are hard to make out.  Interesting concept with very nice toning.  I''d like to see a little less noise, though.</td>', 'I like the idea, but this one your subjects are hard to make out.  Interesting concept with very nice toning.  I''d like to see a little less noise, though.', '2006-11-20 01:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045659, 429250, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines.  I''d like to see some more color in that sky, but controlling nature is tough.</td>', 'Great leading lines.  I''d like to see some more color in that sky, but controlling nature is tough.', '2006-11-20 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045661, 428307, 66515, '<td valign="top">The snow capped mountains in the middle could use some more contrast from the sky. Nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'The snow capped mountains in the middle could use some more contrast from the sky. Nice shot otherwise.', '2006-11-20 01:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045663, 427805, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little bit blurry. The border you chose also works against the framing you''ve implemented with the trees.</td>', 'A little bit blurry. The border you chose also works against the framing you''ve implemented with the trees.', '2006-11-20 01:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045667, 428413, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great subject and idea, but the missing foot from the front soldier hurts this one.  It leads the viewer''s eye right out of the frame.</td>', 'Great subject and idea, but the missing foot from the front soldier hurts this one.  It leads the viewer''s eye right out of the frame.', '2006-11-20 01:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045671, 429080, 36065, '<td valign="top">Great color and a terrific capture of Denver.  I wish that trailer wasn''t sitting there in the foreground.</td>', 'Great color and a terrific capture of Denver.  I wish that trailer wasn''t sitting there in the foreground.', '2006-11-20 01:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045672, 429319, 5885, '<td valign="top">You should have done a little dodging under the hat to allow us to see the eyes a bit better.</td>', 'You should have done a little dodging under the hat to allow us to see the eyes a bit better.', '2006-11-20 01:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045674, 429304, 50641, '<td valign="top">Love it. Thank  you.</td>', 'Love it. Thank  you.', '2006-11-20 01:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045675, 429116, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little bit blurry. The composition also looks a little strange. (The water line could be highter or lower for instance)</td>', 'A little bit blurry. The composition also looks a little strange. (The water line could be highter or lower for instance)', '2006-11-20 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045676, 429364, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2006-11-20 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3045680, 428547, 5885, '<td valign="top">:-)</td>', ':-)', '2006-11-20 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045681, 429332, 65025, '<td valign="top">I''m in Montana right now for Thanksgiving break.  I''m originally from Butte...ANYWAY...I really like the snow on top of the mountain, and the time of day you captured the barn.</td>', 'I''m in Montana right now for Thanksgiving break.  I''m originally from Butte...ANYWAY...I really like the snow on top of the mountain, and the time of day you captured the barn.', '2006-11-20 01:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045686, 428617, 66515, '<td valign="top">Your horizon line could be either a little higher or lower. The image is also not quite balanced. (All the sheep are on the left hand side of the picture without some element to balance things on the right). Can''t wait to find out where this is because I was in Scotland over the summer and I loved it.</td>', 'Your horizon line could be either a little higher or lower. The image is also not quite balanced. (All the sheep are on the left hand side of the picture without some element to balance things on the right). Can''t wait to find out where this is because I was in Scotland over the summer and I loved it.', '2006-11-20 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045687, 428547, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute one, the kind i like to collect. :)</td>', 'cute one, the kind i like to collect. :)', '2006-11-20 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045688, 429421, 65025, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty hard to read because all of the letters are spaced apart the same, the text is small, and it''s diagonally.  But it''s a very creative shot.</td>', 'It''s pretty hard to read because all of the letters are spaced apart the same, the text is small, and it''s diagonally.  But it''s a very creative shot.', '2006-11-20 01:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045690, 429417, 66515, '<td valign="top">The top and bottom borders could be smaller. The text is taking a lot of attention from the beautiful shot you took. 5</td>', 'The top and bottom borders could be smaller. The text is taking a lot of attention from the beautiful shot you took. 5', '2006-11-20 01:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045692, 428811, 65025, '<td valign="top">Very lovley photo, but the text is a bit clunky.</td>', 'Very lovley photo, but the text is a bit clunky.', '2006-11-20 01:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045695, 429002, 66515, '<td valign="top">Text could have added to this image. Its a great picture but its size (relatively square) work against it as a postcard. This also looks oversaturated.</td>', 'Text could have added to this image. Its a great picture but its size (relatively square) work against it as a postcard. This also looks oversaturated.', '2006-11-20 01:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045696, 428743, 65025, '<td valign="top">Most of the time the historical ype photos don''t work for me...but this one really does.  The text fits well, and the image isn''t overdone.</td>', 'Most of the time the historical ype photos don''t work for me...but this one really does.  The text fits well, and the image isn''t overdone.', '2006-11-20 01:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045699, 427053, 66515, '<td valign="top">The grainy look doesn''t make this appear old, just grainy. Its also a little underexposed in places.</td>', 'The grainy look doesn''t make this appear old, just grainy. Its also a little underexposed in places.', '2006-11-20 01:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045702, 429229, 65025, '<td valign="top">I love it!  A very new take on this challenge.  A very cool photo.</td>', 'I love it!  A very new take on this challenge.  A very cool photo.', '2006-11-20 01:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045704, 429250, 5885, '<td valign="top">The best think about Mississippi is I-10 East :-) j/k... love the shot</td>', 'The best think about Mississippi is I-10 East :-) j/k... love the shot', '2006-11-20 01:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045707, 428068, 16241, '<td valign="top">go sell it to them immediately!</td>', 'go sell it to them immediately!', '2006-11-20 01:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045709, 428342, 5885, '<td valign="top">I''m moving... please get me in contact with the Welcome Committee :-)</td>', 'I''m moving... please get me in contact with the Welcome Committee :-)', '2006-11-20 01:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045710, 429384, 66515, '<td valign="top">The text at the top takes away from the visual appeal of the rest of the picture. The text you included at the bottom is far more effective since its descriptive but doesn''t take away from the picture. If you were to actually crop this picture just below the top text and above the circle it would look great.</td>', 'The text at the top takes away from the visual appeal of the rest of the picture. The text you included at the bottom is far more effective since its descriptive but doesn''t take away from the picture. If you were to actually crop this picture just below the top text and above the circle it would look great.', '2006-11-20 01:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045711, 428547, 65025, '<td valign="top">Yeah!  Great idea!  I could totally see this one in the shops! 8</td>', 'Yeah!  Great idea!  I could totally see this one in the shops! 8', '2006-11-20 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045712, 429056, 5885, '<td valign="top">That model rocks... and that photo rocks :-)</td>', 'That model rocks... and that photo rocks :-)', '2006-11-20 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045713, 429416, 5885, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective... great work!</td>', 'Awesome perspective... great work!', '2006-11-20 01:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045717, 429433, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2006-11-20 01:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045718, 428928, 65025, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative...It''s like an optical illusion...wow.</td>', 'Very cool and creative...It''s like an optical illusion...wow.', '2006-11-20 01:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045720, 427706, 65025, '<td valign="top">It looks like it needs to be color corrected.</td>', 'It looks like it needs to be color corrected.', '2006-11-20 01:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045722, 429418, 66515, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know what part of Alberta this is in (since I''m an Albertan myself). In any event, the image is a little dark on the left hand side. Cropping the image to just take out the cow on the left would have made this image superb. The text is a little bit blocky (of course I am not voting based on the text and I am merely remarking on it).</td>', 'I''d like to know what part of Alberta this is in (since I''m an Albertan myself). In any event, the image is a little dark on the left hand side. Cropping the image to just take out the cow on the left would have made this image superb. The text is a little bit blocky (of course I am not voting based on the text and I am merely remarking on it).', '2006-11-20 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045725, 429015, 66515, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t going to vote based on text however in this one I have. The red text with the back ground colors kills this image. The viewer''s eye is drawn to the text with a fish hook.</td>', 'I wasn''t going to vote based on text however in this one I have. The red text with the back ground colors kills this image. The viewer''s eye is drawn to the text with a fish hook.', '2006-11-20 01:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045727, 429060, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2006-11-20 01:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045732, 428492, 65025, '<td valign="top">The rock structure is overly blue.  But very beautiful photo.</td>', 'The rock structure is overly blue.  But very beautiful photo.', '2006-11-20 01:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045736, 428876, 50641, '<td valign="top">hahaha...</td>', 'hahaha...', '2006-11-20 01:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045738, 429018, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to your postcard. Very unique.</td>', 'Interesting approach to your postcard. Very unique.', '2006-11-20 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3045742, 428679, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-11-20 01:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
