(3045800, 428765, 66515, '<td valign="top">The structure in the center is a distraction because we can''t see it in its entirety. A different angle would help.</td>', 'The structure in the center is a distraction because we can''t see it in its entirety. A different angle would help.', '2006-11-20 02:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
