(3046452, 428977, 29571, '<td valign="top">Lubeck is one of the nicest citys in Germany that I have been to. And has got a great tivoli :o) I think that this photo is ok but dos not capture the beauty of Lubeck as I remember it. But I will give you a 7. Auf widersehen.</td>', 'Lubeck is one of the nicest citys in Germany that I have been to. And has got a great tivoli :o) I think that this photo is ok but dos not capture the beauty of Lubeck as I remember it. But I will give you a 7. Auf widersehen.', '2006-11-20 06:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046459, 427657, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, well executed. had placed a thin black border around the image and made the text a little smaller, though</td>', 'excellent idea, well executed. had placed a thin black border around the image and made the text a little smaller, though', '2006-11-20 06:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
