(3046472, 429207, 57886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture and a well  made postcard... Lovely place. Good colors, the white of the snow and the blue of the sky work well together.</td>', 'Beautiful picture and a well  made postcard... Lovely place. Good colors, the white of the snow and the blue of the sky work well together.', '2006-11-20 06:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
