(3046510, 429277, 31443, '<td valign="top">The crescent Moon makes this very special, always a spectacular scene...you''ve done a perfect job.</td>', 'The crescent Moon makes this very special, always a spectacular scene...you''ve done a perfect job.', '2006-11-20 07:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046525, 428131, 36606, '<td valign="top">nice shot. Not sure how well it will do due to the large dark areas.I would also say that there isnt a interesting subject to the photo. The thames further downstream in Richmond or Ham would have sold the thames more. Or maybe here earlier in the evening. 6</td>', 'nice shot. Not sure how well it will do due to the large dark areas.I would also say that there isnt a interesting subject to the photo. The thames further downstream in Richmond or Ham would have sold the thames more. Or maybe here earlier in the evening. 6', '2006-11-20 07:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
