(3046559, 429015, 56658, '<td valign="top">the text doesn''t really work for me where it is. it doesn''t really stand out. perhaps if there was more dead space on the bottom to put it or add a border to put it on.</td>', 'the text doesn''t really work for me where it is. it doesn''t really stand out. perhaps if there was more dead space on the bottom to put it or add a border to put it on.', '2006-11-20 07:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046563, 429393, 56658, '<td valign="top">the dirtiness of the bottom part distracts from it as a postcard. not sure people would want to buy a postcard that showed how dirty a city can. get.</td>', 'the dirtiness of the bottom part distracts from it as a postcard. not sure people would want to buy a postcard that showed how dirty a city can. get.', '2006-11-20 07:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046572, 429294, 4967, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Gorgeous image... hopefully I''ll make it through 20% so that my 10 on this will count!  Nicely done... I''d be interested in which camera was used/time/lack of noise.</td>', 'WOW!  Gorgeous image... hopefully I''ll make it through 20% so that my 10 on this will count!  Nicely done... I''d be interested in which camera was used/time/lack of noise.', '2006-11-20 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
