(3046588, 429344, 66353, '<td valign="top">I really like the layour of this postcard - and the B&amp;W presentation is perfect. I just wish you had done some perspective correction - if that had been the case this would have been in my top 10.</td>', 'I really like the layour of this postcard - and the B&W presentation is perfect. I just wish you had done some perspective correction - if that had been the case this would have been in my top 10.', '2006-11-20 08:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
