(3046644, 428765, 43774, '<td valign="top">I was in Washington last weekend (why couldn''t the challenge have been then? LOL).<br/>This is beautiful, you''ve managed to capture the 3 major elements on The Mall in one stunning photo. I bought some postcards while I was there but none as beautiful as this. If this had been on the rack I would have bought it. <br/>10 from me</td>', 'I was in Washington last weekend (why couldn''t the challenge have been then? LOL).This is beautiful, you''ve managed to capture the 3 major elements on The Mall in one stunning photo. I bought some postcards while I was there but none as beautiful as this. If this had been on the rack I would have bought it. 10 from me', '2006-11-20 08:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046647, 429116, 40430, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry</td>', 'a bit blurry', '2006-11-20 08:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046649, 429421, 43774, '<td valign="top">I find that text really hard to read.</td>', 'I find that text really hard to read.', '2006-11-20 08:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046655, 428698, 40430, '<td valign="top">I lived here for a while a remember this station well. Have you tried this as a B/W image? Try Red''s Smokehouse on Riverside Drive for some grub if you are still there.</td>', 'I lived here for a while a remember this station well. Have you tried this as a B/W image? Try Red''s Smokehouse on Riverside Drive for some grub if you are still there.', '2006-11-20 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046661, 429297, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not overly keen on the size or style of writing you have chosen to write Kentucky - doesn''t seem to match the classy feel of the rest of the postcard.  Apart from that I do like it.</td>', 'Not overly keen on the size or style of writing you have chosen to write Kentucky - doesn''t seem to match the classy feel of the rest of the postcard.  Apart from that I do like it.', '2006-11-20 08:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046667, 427657, 40430, '<td valign="top">great vision, composition, color and exposure. -10-</td>', 'great vision, composition, color and exposure. -10-', '2006-11-20 08:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046669, 427168, 40430, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2006-11-20 08:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046675, 429221, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely light on the old stone work.  Sharpness seems a bit off and the contrast not quite right - I can''t quite put my finger on it.  There is a slight yellow band on the horizon which detracts a little, but over-all I do like this, and it is certainly a classic postcard style shot.</td>', 'Lovely light on the old stone work.  Sharpness seems a bit off and the contrast not quite right - I can''t quite put my finger on it.  There is a slight yellow band on the horizon which detracts a little, but over-all I do like this, and it is certainly a classic postcard style shot.', '2006-11-20 08:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046692, 428876, 42013, '<td valign="top">:) Where in the world is...?</td>', ':) Where in the world is...?', '2006-11-20 08:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046697, 428399, 67258, '<td valign="top">The passenger gazing out of the back window adds considerably to this shot.  Nonetheless, I would have liked to see a bit more of the street - the tram tracks look as though they would have made an interesting feature.</td>', 'The passenger gazing out of the back window adds considerably to this shot.  Nonetheless, I would have liked to see a bit more of the street - the tram tracks look as though they would have made an interesting feature.', '2006-11-20 08:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
