(3046869, 429283, 64175, '<td valign="top">The giffen and bench are nice subject matter. Nice Composition.  However, the leaves reseting on the seating area convey a feeling of abandonment in my opinion. If the leaves were of striking Autumn colors, it would feel like "Fall". But since the leaves are brown/dead, in this case, it makes me feel more of a place I would not particularly want to visit.  Score: 6.</td>', 'The giffen and bench are nice subject matter. Nice Composition.  However, the leaves reseting on the seating area convey a feeling of abandonment in my opinion. If the leaves were of striking Autumn colors, it would feel like "Fall". But since the leaves are brown/dead, in this case, it makes me feel more of a place I would not particularly want to visit.  Score: 6.', '2006-11-20 09:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
