(3046908, 429376, 60915, '<td valign="top">Classic postcard shot, I reckon it fits the challenge perfectly : )</td>', 'Classic postcard shot, I reckon it fits the challenge perfectly : )', '2006-11-20 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046911, 429068, 64175, '<td valign="top">I think a more flowing form or elegant font as this bridge against the black and its fine lines has more of an elegant feel to it. Score: 6.</td>', 'I think a more flowing form or elegant font as this bridge against the black and its fine lines has more of an elegant feel to it. Score: 6.', '2006-11-20 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046915, 429208, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this. Different and something you''d see at a post card shop at any coast. Wish it had text. ;~D</td>', 'I love this. Different and something you''d see at a post card shop at any coast. Wish it had text. ;~D', '2006-11-20 09:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046917, 429322, 64175, '<td valign="top">WOW!  okay, can you tell it got me with the wow factor?  Great shot.  Centered dead-on which works well in this postcard.  Now, the one drawback is that it doesn''t tell me where "The Land of Enchantment" is, but the shot itself it awesome.  I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'WOW!  okay, can you tell it got me with the wow factor?  Great shot.  Centered dead-on which works well in this postcard.  Now, the one drawback is that it doesn''t tell me where "The Land of Enchantment" is, but the shot itself it awesome.  I''m giving it a 10.', '2006-11-20 09:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046918, 429418, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!!!  Wish that one post wasn''t "poking" the cow to the left. Otherwise - I love it.</td>', 'AWESOME!!!!  Wish that one post wasn''t "poking" the cow to the left. Otherwise - I love it.', '2006-11-20 09:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046919, 429190, 60915, '<td valign="top">Yep, I''d buy this postcard. The tightish crop works very well.</td>', 'Yep, I''d buy this postcard. The tightish crop works very well.', '2006-11-20 09:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046920, 429332, 15711, '<td valign="top">YES. Great font too. Love the blue/yellow complementary colors.  Looks just like a post card.</td>', 'YES. Great font too. Love the blue/yellow complementary colors.  Looks just like a post card.', '2006-11-20 09:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046921, 429435, 64175, '<td valign="top">The pcitrue feels like it has a lot of noise in it.  The composition is great!, but the overall clarity of the details leaves something to be desired.  Score: 5.</td>', 'The pcitrue feels like it has a lot of noise in it.  The composition is great!, but the overall clarity of the details leaves something to be desired.  Score: 5.', '2006-11-20 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046928, 428287, 15711, '<td valign="top">The bird makes the shot for me. Not crazy about the purple font.</td>', 'The bird makes the shot for me. Not crazy about the purple font.', '2006-11-20 09:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046929, 428537, 49109, '<td valign="top">the perfect moment - great capture</td>', 'the perfect moment - great capture', '2006-11-20 09:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046930, 428547, 56254, '<td valign="top">seems like a last minute attempt to get an entry in ... looks like the on-camera flash was used also, creating a hot spot on the sharpie ...sorry</td>', 'seems like a last minute attempt to get an entry in ... looks like the on-camera flash was used also, creating a hot spot on the sharpie ...sorry', '2006-11-20 09:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046932, 428676, 49109, '<td valign="top">oops, a typing error...</td>', 'oops, a typing error...', '2006-11-20 09:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046933, 429212, 49109, '<td valign="top">shadow of text makes no sense, otherwise nice shot</td>', 'shadow of text makes no sense, otherwise nice shot', '2006-11-20 09:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046935, 427670, 64175, '<td valign="top">The picture itself is a 10. I don''t think the blue chosen for the text was the right choice. Not sure what color would have worked best, but the blue feels really out of place in my opinion and is a distraction. I think just going with the simple Seattle Aquarium title would have worked and maybe choose the same yellow from the center of the anema (sp).  Score: 9.</td>', 'The picture itself is a 10. I don''t think the blue chosen for the text was the right choice. Not sure what color would have worked best, but the blue feels really out of place in my opinion and is a distraction. I think just going with the simple Seattle Aquarium title would have worked and maybe choose the same yellow from the center of the anema (sp).  Score: 9.', '2006-11-20 09:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046936, 427215, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the branches of a beautiful landscape. I''m not overly excited with the font chosen, but the image more than makes up for it.</td>', 'Nice framing with the branches of a beautiful landscape. I''m not overly excited with the font chosen, but the image more than makes up for it.', '2006-11-20 09:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046937, 427168, 56254, '<td valign="top">what place is this supposed to represent?  having a hard time with this entry ... sorry ...</td>', 'what place is this supposed to represent?  having a hard time with this entry ... sorry ...', '2006-11-20 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046939, 428778, 24454, '<td valign="top">Dang. . .there my cow-adoring heart goes to mush :)   This is PERFECT for my home state!   Just made it a favorite!</td>', 'Dang. . .there my cow-adoring heart goes to mush :)   This is PERFECT for my home state!   Just made it a favorite!', '2006-11-20 09:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046940, 429448, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you used a tripod here or not, but you REALLY need to use a tripod and a *much* longer exposure to capture this.  It''s far too dark, I''m afraid.  On a night when the lights are on at PNC Park, I''d close in on the city itself so you don''t have to worry about those lights blowing everything out.  Leave the exposure open for several seconds... like 2" at f5, or something, and you''ll get a much more pleasing result, and there will be detail in the shadow areas.  Here, we can''t distinguish between the rivers and the trees on the shoreline.</td>', 'Not sure if you used a tripod here or not, but you REALLY need to use a tripod and a *much* longer exposure to capture this.  It''s far too dark, I''m afraid.  On a night when the lights are on at PNC Park, I''d close in on the city itself so you don''t have to worry about those lights blowing everything out.  Leave the exposure open for several seconds... like 2" at f5, or something, and you''ll get a much more pleasing result, and there will be detail in the shadow areas.  Here, we can''t distinguish between the rivers and the trees on the shoreline.', '2006-11-20 09:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046941, 429237, 49109, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it called "Transsylvania"? And is this really there? Good shot, but the "Old Typewriter" font ain''t the best choice...</td>', 'Isn''t it called "Transsylvania"? And is this really there? Good shot, but the "Old Typewriter" font ain''t the best choice...', '2006-11-20 09:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046942, 428928, 64175, '<td valign="top">The horizontal stripe at the top is distracting in my opinion, but I really like the shot and the bright green of the moss/grass.  Score: 7.</td>', 'The horizontal stripe at the top is distracting in my opinion, but I really like the shot and the bright green of the moss/grass.  Score: 7.', '2006-11-20 09:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046943, 429265, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have added a drop shadow or a stroke around the lettering; it gets lost in the image here.</td>', 'I might have added a drop shadow or a stroke around the lettering; it gets lost in the image here.', '2006-11-20 09:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046946, 429312, 64175, '<td valign="top">The colors are fantastic. The dome is a bit blown out. Score: 8.</td>', 'The colors are fantastic. The dome is a bit blown out. Score: 8.', '2006-11-20 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046947, 428115, 49109, '<td valign="top">That''s why I love the Spain. Great impression.</td>', 'That''s why I love the Spain. Great impression.', '2006-11-20 09:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046948, 428135, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great reflection and peaceful scene.  Not sure if it was intentional or not, but the border is uneven.</td>', 'Great reflection and peaceful scene.  Not sure if it was intentional or not, but the border is uneven.', '2006-11-20 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046949, 428430, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall too bright</td>', 'overall too bright', '2006-11-20 09:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046952, 428961, 51538, '<td valign="top">I remember that place from my young days of growing up in WA.</td>', 'I remember that place from my young days of growing up in WA.', '2006-11-20 09:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046953, 427809, 49109, '<td valign="top">LOL, what a good idea. Font matches perfectly.</td>', 'LOL, what a good idea. Font matches perfectly.', '2006-11-20 09:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
