(3046955, 428492, 64175, '<td valign="top">Wow, Ribbon material here. Great shot and my favorite fo the bunch. As a matter of fact, I''m going to add it to my favorites now. 10.</td>', 'Wow, Ribbon material here. Great shot and my favorite fo the bunch. As a matter of fact, I''m going to add it to my favorites now. 10.', '2006-11-20 09:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
