(3046968, 429444, 64175, '<td valign="top">Picture looks a little over sharpened, or perhaps something happened in resizing for the web as the heron''s beak is very pixelated. I think it may have been more effective as well to leave off the burning around the "Gulf Of Mexico" text.  I like the choice font. Score: 5.</td>', 'Picture looks a little over sharpened, or perhaps something happened in resizing for the web as the heron''s beak is very pixelated. I think it may have been more effective as well to leave off the burning around the "Gulf Of Mexico" text.  I like the choice font. Score: 5.', '2006-11-20 09:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3046972, 428893, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset/sunrise. Hopefully the flip side would have conveyed the message you are using as a title. I think some text would have enhanced this image in the challenge criteria (postcard).  Score: 7.</td>', 'Nice sunset/sunrise. Hopefully the flip side would have conveyed the message you are using as a title. I think some text would have enhanced this image in the challenge criteria (postcard).  Score: 7.', '2006-11-20 09:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
