(3046981, 429186, 64175, '<td valign="top">The building in the middle is a little blown out, but the composition and clarity of shot is very nice.  9.</td>', 'The building in the middle is a little blown out, but the composition and clarity of shot is very nice.  9.', '2006-11-20 09:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
