(3046993, 429438, 51538, '<td valign="top">That ghastly MTA ventilation building (the orange one) is one to be avoided at all costs in this view.  You should have been more to the north...</td>', 'That ghastly MTA ventilation building (the orange one) is one to be avoided at all costs in this view.  You should have been more to the north...', '2006-11-20 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
