(3047297, 429208, 64929, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot....it would have been a *10* for me with text;  without, a *8*</td>', 'I adore this shot....it would have been a *10* for me with text;  without, a *8*', '2006-11-20 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047300, 427514, 61191, '<td valign="top">I think there are some noise/artifact issues. Perhaps as a result from processing. The clouds are blown out - the viewers eye is drawn towards them not to the building. But overall I like your idea, the subject and your composition!</td>', 'I think there are some noise/artifact issues. Perhaps as a result from processing. The clouds are blown out - the viewers eye is drawn towards them not to the building. But overall I like your idea, the subject and your composition!', '2006-11-20 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047302, 429043, 52713, '<td valign="top">A bit over processed. I like the increased saturation but I think you went to far on the sharpening.</td>', 'A bit over processed. I like the increased saturation but I think you went to far on the sharpening.', '2006-11-20 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047303, 429267, 66384, '<td valign="top">This picture would be more appealing if the detail of the white feathers had not been blown out. Remember to darken the exposure when shooting white in intense light. The details in the dark areas can always be restored in post processing. Also, the water seems over sharpened, which causes it to compete with the bird.</td>', 'This picture would be more appealing if the detail of the white feathers had not been blown out. Remember to darken the exposure when shooting white in intense light. The details in the dark areas can always be restored in post processing. Also, the water seems over sharpened, which causes it to compete with the bird.', '2006-11-20 11:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047304, 429268, 61191, '<td valign="top">Simple and calm - I like you different approach to this. The text is perhaps a bit too large.</td>', 'Simple and calm - I like you different approach to this. The text is perhaps a bit too large.', '2006-11-20 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047306, 429221, 64929, '<td valign="top">A bit overprocessed, IMHO, and in need of text to identify the location...but what a cool location it is!</td>', 'A bit overprocessed, IMHO, and in need of text to identify the location...but what a cool location it is!', '2006-11-20 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047310, 428700, 64929, '<td valign="top">Unusual choice of text...very intriguing shot</td>', 'Unusual choice of text...very intriguing shot', '2006-11-20 11:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047314, 429372, 64929, '<td valign="top">The font gets a bit lost in the shot but great capture nonetheless</td>', 'The font gets a bit lost in the shot but great capture nonetheless', '2006-11-20 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047316, 429192, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but not sure about the postcard appeal.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but not sure about the postcard appeal.', '2006-11-20 11:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047317, 429181, 61191, '<td valign="top">Brr, looks cold! When everyone is doing city-/landscape you thought out of the box - I like that :) The image quality in terms of compression etc. suffered here: I can see strange patterns and colors.</td>', 'Brr, looks cold! When everyone is doing city-/landscape you thought out of the box - I like that :) The image quality in terms of compression etc. suffered here: I can see strange patterns and colors.', '2006-11-20 11:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047321, 428928, 52713, '<td valign="top">very nice. I like the minimalist quality. 7 for now</td>', 'very nice. I like the minimalist quality. 7 for now', '2006-11-20 11:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047324, 429045, 64929, '<td valign="top">Love the shot and choice of font....beautiful! Wish the border was a bit wider on the sides/top   *9*</td>', 'Love the shot and choice of font....beautiful! Wish the border was a bit wider on the sides/top   *9*', '2006-11-20 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047326, 429150, 64929, '<td valign="top">Interesting side border...beautiful capture</td>', 'Interesting side border...beautiful capture', '2006-11-20 11:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047330, 429256, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great choice of font....gorgeous capture! *10*</td>', 'Great choice of font....gorgeous capture! *10*', '2006-11-20 11:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047331, 429344, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think color is more appealing on postcards. Very nice graphic work.</td>', 'I think color is more appealing on postcards. Very nice graphic work.', '2006-11-20 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047332, 427413, 52713, '<td valign="top">text quality isn''t doing you any favors.</td>', 'text quality isn''t doing you any favors.', '2006-11-20 11:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047333, 429094, 64929, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture - well done! *9*</td>', 'Beautiful capture - well done! *9*', '2006-11-20 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047337, 428974, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, color, and contrast. I''d buy it.</td>', 'Nice mood, color, and contrast. I''d buy it.', '2006-11-20 11:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047339, 429060, 29591, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a bit more of the bike and the house.</td>', 'I would like to see a bit more of the bike and the house.', '2006-11-20 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047342, 429340, 56828, '<td valign="top">Technical:  The lights are bothersome when looking at the photo.  Too bright, too much of an orange tent.  The orange color then saturates more than half of the photo (even areas where there is no light). You don''t see much detail of what you are looking at.  There also isn''t much focus in your subject.<br/> <br/>Other:  Compared to most of the other photos in this challenge it is of lower quality (but this challenge is also filled with some AMAZING photos).  So don''t be discourage by a lower score.</td>', 'Technical:  The lights are bothersome when looking at the photo.  Too bright, too much of an orange tent.  The orange color then saturates more than half of the photo (even areas where there is no light). You don''t see much detail of what you are looking at.  There also isn''t much focus in your subject. Other:  Compared to most of the other photos in this challenge it is of lower quality (but this challenge is also filled with some AMAZING photos).  So don''t be discourage by a lower score.', '2006-11-20 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047343, 427168, 29591, '<td valign="top">Great image and PP, not sure if its a great postcard. Need a frame I think :D</td>', 'Great image and PP, not sure if its a great postcard. Need a frame I think :D', '2006-11-20 11:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047344, 429439, 29591, '<td valign="top">Great Postcard.</td>', 'Great Postcard.', '2006-11-20 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047345, 429251, 29591, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Looks a bit oversharpened.', '2006-11-20 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047346, 429261, 29591, '<td valign="top">Great postcard for a zoo!!</td>', 'Great postcard for a zoo!!', '2006-11-20 11:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047347, 427801, 56828, '<td valign="top">Way too much  noise, there is no sharpness, and even your words aren''t focused.  I''m not sure if you added noise afterwards, but the noise as over done here.</td>', 'Way too much  noise, there is no sharpness, and even your words aren''t focused.  I''m not sure if you added noise afterwards, but the noise as over done here.', '2006-11-20 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047348, 428765, 64929, '<td valign="top">Love how the border wraps with the text - great capture!!!</td>', 'Love how the border wraps with the text - great capture!!!', '2006-11-20 11:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047349, 429308, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot! It looks like a close-up on an eye, reflecting the mall. Not sure about the postcard appeal. It may be too artsy for the postcard public.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot! It looks like a close-up on an eye, reflecting the mall. Not sure about the postcard appeal. It may be too artsy for the postcard public.', '2006-11-20 11:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047350, 428342, 61191, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I think I know who this is: crazy Aussie, thinking different, likes nude shots...  I really like this kind of humor! :) Great that you thought outside the box. I give you a 10 to compensate those "I''m too prude to see naked people" - folks that will vote you down ;)</td>', 'Yeah, I think I know who this is: crazy Aussie, thinking different, likes nude shots...  I really like this kind of humor! :) Great that you thought outside the box. I give you a 10 to compensate those "I''m too prude to see naked people" - folks that will vote you down ;)', '2006-11-20 11:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047351, 429325, 64929, '<td valign="top">Font is too small - gets lost - but great capture!</td>', 'Font is too small - gets lost - but great capture!', '2006-11-20 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047352, 427168, 56828, '<td valign="top">The photo lacks focus.  You could have made the colors jump out more also.  Some text on the photo may have helped as well.  If the rose were more sharp this would score higher.</td>', 'The photo lacks focus.  You could have made the colors jump out more also.  Some text on the photo may have helped as well.  If the rose were more sharp this would score higher.', '2006-11-20 11:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047357, 428726, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I would have left off the "Wonderful" and just put "Copenhagen"</td>', 'Great shot!  I would have left off the "Wonderful" and just put "Copenhagen"', '2006-11-20 11:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047359, 429319, 61191, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it. What do you want to express? Is this a site or a town?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it. What do you want to express? Is this a site or a town?', '2006-11-20 11:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047362, 429365, 64929, '<td valign="top">Chicago is a bold city...needed more of a bolder font size to match - cool perspective though</td>', 'Chicago is a bold city...needed more of a bolder font size to match - cool perspective though', '2006-11-20 11:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047363, 429310, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good job of using the blue for the moodiness of Gothan City.  I''m not sure about the placement of the text, but I don''t see a better spot for it.</td>', 'Good job of using the blue for the moodiness of Gothan City.  I''m not sure about the placement of the text, but I don''t see a better spot for it.', '2006-11-20 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3047365, 428149, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great shot...would have been better with font/text identifying the location and a subtle border</td>', 'Great shot...would have been better with font/text identifying the location and a subtle border', '2006-11-20 11:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047366, 429262, 64571, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!', '2006-11-20 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047368, 429163, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great shot but needed a bolder/larger font</td>', 'Great shot but needed a bolder/larger font', '2006-11-20 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047371, 428106, 64929, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m biased (I was born in Charleston) but this shot rocks!  I would have liked to see a bolder border but it''s still awesome!</td>', 'Maybe I''m biased (I was born in Charleston) but this shot rocks!  I would have liked to see a bolder border but it''s still awesome!', '2006-11-20 11:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047372, 429417, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m a little bothered by the front door being blocked by the arch over the gate. You want the shot to say WELCOME. If the it had been taken from a sidestep to the right, the door would have been framed by the arch, inviting guests to enter.</td>', 'I''m a little bothered by the front door being blocked by the arch over the gate. You want the shot to say WELCOME. If the it had been taken from a sidestep to the right, the door would have been framed by the arch, inviting guests to enter.', '2006-11-20 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047373, 427671, 61191, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but too dark IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting subject but too dark IMHO.', '2006-11-20 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047375, 429339, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful. Really doesn''t say much about Colorado. It could have been taken anywhere.</td>', 'Nice and colorful. Really doesn''t say much about Colorado. It could have been taken anywhere.', '2006-11-20 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047376, 428374, 60770, '<td valign="top">I love the photograph but I really can''t stand the type. Perhaps it could be worked in differently or left out.</td>', 'I love the photograph but I really can''t stand the type. Perhaps it could be worked in differently or left out.', '2006-11-20 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047381, 429248, 64571, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - I love the clouds coming out of the trees!</td>', 'This is beautiful - I love the clouds coming out of the trees!', '2006-11-20 11:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047383, 429199, 29591, '<td valign="top">yeah, too tacky for me ;)</td>', 'yeah, too tacky for me ;)', '2006-11-20 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047386, 429310, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see the top of this shot cropped to a little above the text. The bright sky above the clouds detracts from the cityscape. And by cropping that portion, you would have a more standard postcard size. I''d also pick a nicer font. Courier doesn''t have much appeal.</td>', 'I''d prefer to see the top of this shot cropped to a little above the text. The bright sky above the clouds detracts from the cityscape. And by cropping that portion, you would have a more standard postcard size. I''d also pick a nicer font. Courier doesn''t have much appeal.', '2006-11-20 11:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047389, 429261, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful postcard. I''d buy it.</td>', 'Wonderful postcard. I''d buy it.', '2006-11-20 11:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047393, 428676, 29591, '<td valign="top">The chair of the left is disctracting. IMHO would have been better to have it complete or not at all. But really nice though.</td>', 'The chair of the left is disctracting. IMHO would have been better to have it complete or not at all. But really nice though.', '2006-11-20 11:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047395, 428537, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful card. I think it would sell.</td>', 'Beautiful card. I think it would sell.', '2006-11-20 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047400, 428778, 29591, '<td valign="top">In my monitor most of the fur details is lost. But really nice capture.</td>', 'In my monitor most of the fur details is lost. But really nice capture.', '2006-11-20 11:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047401, 429262, 66384, '<td valign="top">That says Paris to me. It''s a beautiful shot and I think it would be a popular postcard.</td>', 'That says Paris to me. It''s a beautiful shot and I think it would be a popular postcard.', '2006-11-20 11:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047402, 429024, 29591, '<td valign="top">I like the font you used. Great colors</td>', 'I like the font you used. Great colors', '2006-11-20 11:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047403, 429045, 29591, '<td valign="top">I really want to go there. Great image</td>', 'I really want to go there. Great image', '2006-11-20 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047409, 428492, 64571, '<td valign="top">Simply magnificant!!!!!</td>', 'Simply magnificant!!!!!', '2006-11-20 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047410, 429294, 64571, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!</td>', 'Spectacular!', '2006-11-20 11:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047411, 429325, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fine illustration of a postcard type image IMO.  You''ve captured the location that shows it in a flattering way.  Good placement of the main subjects within your frame and the hillside diagonal line adds to the composition.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fine illustration of a postcard type image IMO.  You''ve captured the location that shows it in a flattering way.  Good placement of the main subjects within your frame and the hillside diagonal line adds to the composition.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047412, 429039, 66384, '<td valign="top">I find this shot confusing. it seems to be too flat, without any definition between water, land, and boats. Sorry, I''m not sure how to improve that, but the location is definitely postcard-worthy.</td>', 'I find this shot confusing. it seems to be too flat, without any definition between water, land, and boats. Sorry, I''m not sure how to improve that, but the location is definitely postcard-worthy.', '2006-11-20 11:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047416, 428960, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Definitely says London.</td>', 'Great shot. Definitely says London.', '2006-11-20 11:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047417, 428696, 30049, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a fine depiction of ''Arizona'' and it''s western climate.  Very pleasing photo even if it had to stand by itself.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This appears to be a fine depiction of ''Arizona'' and it''s western climate.  Very pleasing photo even if it had to stand by itself.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047418, 429277, 52713, '<td valign="top">classic!</td>', 'classic!', '2006-11-20 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047423, 429421, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can''t read the caption, so I don''t know what I am seeing.</td>', 'I can''t read the caption, so I don''t know what I am seeing.', '2006-11-20 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047426, 427671, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good museum postcard.</td>', 'Very nice. Good museum postcard.', '2006-11-20 11:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047427, 429421, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the birds and the sky provides a nice background.  Placement of  the text is good, but the font chosen and font size makes it difficult to read.</td>', 'Good capture of the birds and the sky provides a nice background.  Placement of  the text is good, but the font chosen and font size makes it difficult to read.', '2006-11-20 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047429, 427415, 30049, '<td valign="top">You should have used matching chairs.  :D  Sorry, have to give you a hard time about something!  Very nice sunset/sunrise scene with a great sky and calm waters.  Relaxing.  Ok, one more nitpik - the horizon seems slightly (very) tilted to the left.  He-he.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'You should have used matching chairs.  :D  Sorry, have to give you a hard time about something!  Very nice sunset/sunrise scene with a great sky and calm waters.  Relaxing.  Ok, one more nitpik - the horizon seems slightly (very) tilted to the left.  He-he.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047433, 428374, 66384, '<td valign="top">Where? The idea is good, but I think it would work better if we could see a good place to be. Also a nicer font for the caption would help.</td>', 'Where? The idea is good, but I think it would work better if we could see a good place to be. Also a nicer font for the caption would help.', '2006-11-20 11:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047440, 429205, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely and unusual. I''d like to go there, and if I had been there, I''d like to send this card to my friends.</td>', 'Lovely and unusual. I''d like to go there, and if I had been there, I''d like to send this card to my friends.', '2006-11-20 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047445, 429116, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a pretty scene.  Nice reflections in the water.  The building seems a little blurred, but not major.  Did you consider two minor crops - get the tree branches out of the right edge, and if you need to adjust the ratio then lose a bit off the bottom to remove the tiny piece of shoreline.  Another consideration would be to zoom in even closer (at time of image capture) to get more of the front of the building, close enough to read the banners to get a better sense of context for the ''Shakespeare'' theme.  You could have still included some of the water reflection, which I''m sure was quite enticing.  :D  May want to move the text up a little to get the ''p'' off the bottom border.  Text color is subjective to a wide range of opinions.  Not sure that I like the color you''ve chosen.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a pretty scene.  Nice reflections in the water.  The building seems a little blurred, but not major.  Did you consider two minor crops - get the tree branches out of the right edge, and if you need to adjust the ratio then lose a bit off the bottom to remove the tiny piece of shoreline.  Another consideration would be to zoom in even closer (at time of image capture) to get more of the front of the building, close enough to read the banners to get a better sense of context for the ''Shakespeare'' theme.  You could have still included some of the water reflection, which I''m sure was quite enticing.  :D  May want to move the text up a little to get the ''p'' off the bottom border.  Text color is subjective to a wide range of opinions.  Not sure that I like the color you''ve chosen.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047447, 429176, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot. Doesn''t say Philadelphia to me -- could be any bridge. Also may be a bit artsy for the postcard public.</td>', 'Good perspective shot. Doesn''t say Philadelphia to me -- could be any bridge. Also may be a bit artsy for the postcard public.', '2006-11-20 12:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
