(3047561, 427168, 44611, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that you didn''t really understand what the challenge was about?  This doesn''t qualify at all as a postcard.  Have a look at the other entries and you will see this immediately.<br/> <br/>Looking at the image away from the challenge criteria, sadly it is rather blurred, the background is distracting (try a wider aperture to blur your backgrounds more) and the central composition is rather dull.</td>', 'I get the feeling that you didn''t really understand what the challenge was about?  This doesn''t qualify at all as a postcard.  Have a look at the other entries and you will see this immediately. Looking at the image away from the challenge criteria, sadly it is rather blurred, the background is distracting (try a wider aperture to blur your backgrounds more) and the central composition is rather dull.', '2006-11-20 12:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047565, 428859, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the arch. Over all, it''s a little gloomy. I wonder if you can increase the luminosity of the arch and background without spoiling the detail on the arch.</td>', 'Great shot of the arch. Over all, it''s a little gloomy. I wonder if you can increase the luminosity of the arch and background without spoiling the detail on the arch.', '2006-11-20 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
