(3047575, 429147, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a shame you have added an extra letter in to Calderdale - hopefuly it shouldn''t harm your scores as I don''t suppose many people know the area, but it screams out to a Yorkshire lass!  Despite that, a lovely and very typical scene, nicely presented.</td>', 'What a shame you have added an extra letter in to Calderdale - hopefuly it shouldn''t harm your scores as I don''t suppose many people know the area, but it screams out to a Yorkshire lass!  Despite that, a lovely and very typical scene, nicely presented.', '2006-11-20 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
