(3047586, 428520, 173, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little fuzzy. When I do long expose photos I manually set the focus on ''infinity'' and that tends to get a clearer photo.</td>', 'This photo seems a little fuzzy. When I do long expose photos I manually set the focus on ''infinity'' and that tends to get a clearer photo.', '2006-11-20 12:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
