(3047597, 428995, 32767, '<td valign="top">I almost never make comments like "too dark" but in this case I think seeing those beautiful structures at least with some detail might have helped me. Very nice silhouette and great sky coloring. Good Luck.</td>', 'I almost never make comments like "too dark" but in this case I think seeing those beautiful structures at least with some detail might have helped me. Very nice silhouette and great sky coloring. Good Luck.', '2006-11-20 12:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
