(3047605, 428775, 173, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a little washed out. It would have been nice to see some more contrast between the sky and the landscape to give things some definition.</td>', 'This photo seems a little washed out. It would have been nice to see some more contrast between the sky and the landscape to give things some definition.', '2006-11-20 12:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047606, 428430, 67258, '<td valign="top">Straightening the horizon would help improve this.</td>', 'Straightening the horizon would help improve this.', '2006-11-20 12:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047608, 429265, 66384, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of potential in this shot, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me. The shape isn''t right for a post card -- I''d crop the right side to remove that half window at the bottom and bring the gray building more to the center. The tree, the window boxes, and the lamps in the window of the gray building are very nice and could be featured more. The colors are too subdued, and the text is overpowering, but those are easy fix. Also, I''d clone out the cars at the bottom.</td>', 'There is a lot of potential in this shot, but as it is, it doesn''t work for me. The shape isn''t right for a post card -- I''d crop the right side to remove that half window at the bottom and bring the gray building more to the center. The tree, the window boxes, and the lamps in the window of the gray building are very nice and could be featured more. The colors are too subdued, and the text is overpowering, but those are easy fix. Also, I''d clone out the cars at the bottom.', '2006-11-20 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3047615, 428840, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice spider shot, but what kind of postcard is that -- something you''d leave on a pillow while you are out.</td>', 'Nice spider shot, but what kind of postcard is that -- something you''d leave on a pillow while you are out.', '2006-11-20 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
