(3047697, 429322, 58610, '<td valign="top">As always, great subject. Not sure I care for the sky treatment. Could be a bit sharper with a little more detail in the shadows.<br/> <br/>A word of caution: If this truely is from the "Land of Enchantment" you might want to check on the Tribal rules of photography for images taken on their land (and you may have already done this). They usually don''t like their images published. I know this from personal experience.</td>', 'As always, great subject. Not sure I care for the sky treatment. Could be a bit sharper with a little more detail in the shadows. A word of caution: If this truely is from the "Land of Enchantment" you might want to check on the Tribal rules of photography for images taken on their land (and you may have already done this). They usually don''t like their images published. I know this from personal experience.', '2006-11-20 13:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
