(3047862, 429229, 30049, '<td valign="top">:D  This is pretty cool!  What are they, lawn ornaments?  I like the way you''ve put this together having the main (largest) windmill in the top left and leaving a little negative space in the top right third.  I know that text isn''t "required" for a postcard, but personally I think it adds to one.  You might be getting dinged a bit for that in scoring.  JMO of course.  BTW, nice job on resizing this and sharpening correctly.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', ':D  This is pretty cool!  What are they, lawn ornaments?  I like the way you''ve put this together having the main (largest) windmill in the top left and leaving a little negative space in the top right third.  I know that text isn''t "required" for a postcard, but personally I think it adds to one.  You might be getting dinged a bit for that in scoring.  JMO of course.  BTW, nice job on resizing this and sharpening correctly.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
