(3047869, 429438, 30049, '<td valign="top">This works fine for a postcard.  Nice job of processing the sky in the background.  Where is the red/orange glow coming from, the sunset/sunrise?  It''s almost too much, like this had the color saturation pushed a little too far maybe?  Just an observation.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This works fine for a postcard.  Nice job of processing the sky in the background.  Where is the red/orange glow coming from, the sunset/sunrise?  It''s almost too much, like this had the color saturation pushed a little too far maybe?  Just an observation.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-20 14:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
