(3048017, 429045, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, I remember this place well! Chateau de Chillon, Montreux? On the shores of Lac Leman? I lived in Geneva from 1957-1961, and spent one summer at a camp in the hills above this structure. Very nicely done, except the greenish/cyan tint in the mid-sky bugs me.</td>', 'Oh, I remember this place well! Chateau de Chillon, Montreux? On the shores of Lac Leman? I lived in Geneva from 1957-1961, and spent one summer at a camp in the hills above this structure. Very nicely done, except the greenish/cyan tint in the mid-sky bugs me.', '2006-11-20 15:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048018, 429185, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t dilike this shot..not at all, in fact it''s really good to look at..I am a bit confused by the title. &lt;?&gt; Island is a place or did you mean ''the'' island? I''m not sure the vast DPCer will get this but the shot is really good with the blue tones.</td>', 'I don''t dilike this shot..not at all, in fact it''s really good to look at..I am a bit confused by the title. <?> Island is a place or did you mean ''the'' island? I''m not sure the vast DPCer will get this but the shot is really good with the blue tones.', '2006-11-20 15:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
