(3048085, 429068, 327, '<td valign="top">Kennewick is one of the hottest places ever !! We rode from Portland to Sturgis 9 times and always hated going into Kennewick, Pasco because it was so hot!! However we loved staying there and meeting the nice people, and eating fresh melons or corn. Great river access too. I''ve never seen the bridge at night. This is great, love the reflections.</td>', 'Kennewick is one of the hottest places ever !! We rode from Portland to Sturgis 9 times and always hated going into Kennewick, Pasco because it was so hot!! However we loved staying there and meeting the nice people, and eating fresh melons or corn. Great river access too. I''ve never seen the bridge at night. This is great, love the reflections.', '2006-11-20 15:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
