(3048366, 428430, 7628, '<td valign="top">I HOPE you are going for the brown ribbon.  Should I list my concerns or have you been very mindful in your inclusion of photographic flaux-pas already?  I''ll be redundant just in case - tilted horizon, no dicernable color, yet not black and white, no tonal range, no subject or focal interest, bad focus, odd text in jarring blue that makes little sense... are there 3, 6, 9 million homes behine you or are there 3 million dollar homes behind you... and are you laughing at the people who shelled out that kind of money just for this view?</td>', 'I HOPE you are going for the brown ribbon.  Should I list my concerns or have you been very mindful in your inclusion of photographic flaux-pas already?  I''ll be redundant just in case - tilted horizon, no dicernable color, yet not black and white, no tonal range, no subject or focal interest, bad focus, odd text in jarring blue that makes little sense... are there 3, 6, 9 million homes behine you or are there 3 million dollar homes behind you... and are you laughing at the people who shelled out that kind of money just for this view?', '2006-11-20 16:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
