(3048422, 429060, 66193, '<td valign="top">seems like a chance snapshot.  a head-on perspective or at least a view of his face would have made for a more personal post-card.  Also the composition is not very strong, with the partial house, the power line coming out of his head, and a partial sign on the left.  I often have trouble with the same thing.  I get so excited about the main subject, and don''t even notice the background until it''s too late (back home a week later!)</td>', 'seems like a chance snapshot.  a head-on perspective or at least a view of his face would have made for a more personal post-card.  Also the composition is not very strong, with the partial house, the power line coming out of his head, and a partial sign on the left.  I often have trouble with the same thing.  I get so excited about the main subject, and don''t even notice the background until it''s too late (back home a week later!)', '2006-11-20 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
