(3048548, 427333, 46031, '<td valign="top">this is a little too close to a square for a postcard. the image looks great, i especially like how the rocks add interest to the foreground. the horizon does seem a little crooked, though.</td>', 'this is a little too close to a square for a postcard. the image looks great, i especially like how the rocks add interest to the foreground. the horizon does seem a little crooked, though.', '2006-11-20 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
