(3048574, 428131, 46031, '<td valign="top">the thing (a dock, i guess) in the lower left hand corner is hard to identify. this really distracts from the wonderful skyline in the background. might have made for a better picture had you not included it and cropped a little closer in the top left hand corner.</td>', 'the thing (a dock, i guess) in the lower left hand corner is hard to identify. this really distracts from the wonderful skyline in the background. might have made for a better picture had you not included it and cropped a little closer in the top left hand corner.', '2006-11-20 17:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048575, 429227, 66597, '<td valign="top">You made Kansas look pretty good!</td>', 'You made Kansas look pretty good!', '2006-11-20 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048577, 429018, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t think the photo is stellar - blurry, etc. - this is so creative that I''ve got to bump it up. 6.</td>', 'Although I don''t think the photo is stellar - blurry, etc. - this is so creative that I''ve got to bump it up. 6.', '2006-11-20 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048578, 428889, 46031, '<td valign="top">great picutre. i like the writing, it does appear to be a little too subtle - at least on my screen.</td>', 'great picutre. i like the writing, it does appear to be a little too subtle - at least on my screen.', '2006-11-20 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048579, 428303, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks really over-processed / over-photoshopped. Sky looks unnatural. Sorry :-(</td>', 'This looks really over-processed / over-photoshopped. Sky looks unnatural. Sorry :-(', '2006-11-20 17:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048581, 429075, 66597, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful long exposure and great lighting.</td>', 'What a beautiful long exposure and great lighting.', '2006-11-20 17:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048589, 427514, 46031, '<td valign="top">it''s kinda odd that you chose to have the border wider on the bottom and not put the text in there</td>', 'it''s kinda odd that you chose to have the border wider on the bottom and not put the text in there', '2006-11-20 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048601, 428863, 5792, '<td valign="top">What makes this composition nice is the diagonal balance between the sun on the upper left and the romantic couple on the lowere right. Placement of the suns refelction to highlight the rock works well to. The birds are good, but very small in the frame.<br/> <br/>Could be my monitor but the image looks a little dark on the couple''s side. Since there is little sky detail and foreground detail placement of your main elements is most important in this composition. For that reason I''d recommend a smaller crop that begins 25 pixels in from the far right, is 60 pixels down from the top and 60 pixels in from the left side. I don''t recommend it because it fits the rule of thirds in several important ways for a landscape image, but because it looks better to me and balances the sun and couple even better than you have it.<br/> <br/>You would have to move your titling, of course. You might try it placing the "W" at a 45 degree angle to the center of the setting sun on the uper right. You might like that positioning best.</td>', 'What makes this composition nice is the diagonal balance between the sun on the upper left and the romantic couple on the lowere right. Placement of the suns refelction to highlight the rock works well to. The birds are good, but very small in the frame. Could be my monitor but the image looks a little dark on the couple''s side. Since there is little sky detail and foreground detail placement of your main elements is most important in this composition. For that reason I''d recommend a smaller crop that begins 25 pixels in from the far right, is 60 pixels down from the top and 60 pixels in from the left side. I don''t recommend it because it fits the rule of thirds in several important ways for a landscape image, but because it looks better to me and balances the sun and couple even better than you have it. You would have to move your titling, of course. You might try it placing the "W" at a 45 degree angle to the center of the setting sun on the uper right. You might like that positioning best.', '2006-11-20 17:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048612, 428928, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture, although I would have cropped out the dark ceiling. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool picture, although I would have cropped out the dark ceiling. Nicely done.', '2006-11-20 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048617, 429094, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the landscape, time of day taken and the flat water. Though this does not work well for postcards, this image might be better as a B&amp;W. It looks a little dark so I''d recomment some dodging to bring out more of that great detail in the reflections in the water. Very nice otherwise.</td>', 'Like the landscape, time of day taken and the flat water. Though this does not work well for postcards, this image might be better as a B&W. It looks a little dark so I''d recomment some dodging to bring out more of that great detail in the reflections in the water. Very nice otherwise.', '2006-11-20 17:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048618, 428564, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m voting this a 6.  Why not a 10?  The buildings all lean to the right.  If you use Photoshop, try exploring the image-&gt;transform-&gt; tools. Skewing the upper left corner to the left would''ve straightened out the buildings.<br/> <br/>Also, the text is hard to read because of the font, shadow, and placement.  Given that it''s Vegas, something neonish in the upper right would''ve made it easy to read.</td>', 'I''m voting this a 6.  Why not a 10?  The buildings all lean to the right.  If you use Photoshop, try exploring the image->transform-> tools. Skewing the upper left corner to the left would''ve straightened out the buildings. Also, the text is hard to read because of the font, shadow, and placement.  Given that it''s Vegas, something neonish in the upper right would''ve made it easy to read.', '2006-11-20 17:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048621, 429277, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and catch of the reflection.  The moon adds to the image as well.  Nicely done! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and catch of the reflection.  The moon adds to the image as well.  Nicely done! <9>', '2006-11-20 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048629, 428900, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness on the cows.  Interesting poster - you got me on the execution (over composition). &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Great sharpness on the cows.  Interesting poster - you got me on the execution (over composition). <7>', '2006-11-20 17:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048636, 428430, 46782, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon is very distracting and I am not a sure about the overall composition.</td>', 'The tilted horizon is very distracting and I am not a sure about the overall composition.', '2006-11-20 17:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048639, 428287, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture!  Only nitpick would be the dimensions (would have liked to see it more in standard postcard dimensions).  Great image though! &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wonderful picture!  Only nitpick would be the dimensions (would have liked to see it more in standard postcard dimensions).  Great image though! <9>', '2006-11-20 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
