(3049392, 429277, 15711, '<td valign="top">The moon really kills me. It mimics the shape of the roof of the building.  A famous landmakr - captured beautifully. Wonderful tone and reflection.</td>', 'The moon really kills me. It mimics the shape of the roof of the building.  A famous landmakr - captured beautifully. Wonderful tone and reflection.', '2006-11-20 22:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
