(3049623, 429202, 22748, '<td valign="top">The weather looks ok to me... :) But seriously, I think the photo is decent, but perhaps too much negative space at the top of the frame, and not enough castle at the bottom. With a little more detail visible in the castle and a bit closer vantage point, I think it would be a little improved.</td>', 'The weather looks ok to me... :) But seriously, I think the photo is decent, but perhaps too much negative space at the top of the frame, and not enough castle at the bottom. With a little more detail visible in the castle and a bit closer vantage point, I think it would be a little improved.', '2006-11-21 00:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
