(3049888, 429260, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think there are lots more exciting places in Tokyo to display than this scene.<br/>  During the challenge shooting week, I think there were a few evenings that Mt Fuji would have been silhouetted beautifully against the sky - I certainly saw it from here in Utsunomiya on Tuesday evening.</td>', 'I think there are lots more exciting places in Tokyo to display than this scene.  During the challenge shooting week, I think there were a few evenings that Mt Fuji would have been silhouetted beautifully against the sky - I certainly saw it from here in Utsunomiya on Tuesday evening.', '2006-11-21 06:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
