(3049939, 429000, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the inclusion of the railway in the foreground, and the way the colours of the distant fields reflect the colours of the track.  perhaps a bit too much uninteresting sky for a postcard, though.</td>', 'I like the inclusion of the railway in the foreground, and the way the colours of the distant fields reflect the colours of the track.  perhaps a bit too much uninteresting sky for a postcard, though.', '2006-11-21 07:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
