(3049990, 428876, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great job! I love AZ. Post card is well put together.</td>', 'Great job! I love AZ. Post card is well put together.', '2006-11-21 08:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3049994, 429060, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a compelling image.  Makes me want to look around a bit.  Guess that works for a postcard also.  :D  The passing bicyclist is moving into the photo with room in front - that''s good.  Do wish I could see more of his face but the lighting wasn''t cooperating for you in that regard.  Looks like there is two, maybe three animals in the front yard of the house in the background?  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a compelling image.  Makes me want to look around a bit.  Guess that works for a postcard also.  :D  The passing bicyclist is moving into the photo with room in front - that''s good.  Do wish I could see more of his face but the lighting wasn''t cooperating for you in that regard.  Looks like there is two, maybe three animals in the front yard of the house in the background?  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 08:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3049997, 429224, 48954, '<td valign="top">Vive le Quebec!</td>', 'Vive le Quebec!', '2006-11-21 08:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3049998, 429187, 30049, '<td valign="top">HDR?  The colors look unnatural and a little flat, especially in the distant tree line around the tower.  A light burn and some contrast boost might help here a little.  All JMO of course.  :D  I like how you''ve incorporated the tree branches (foreground), and water grasses, to create some natural framing.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'HDR?  The colors look unnatural and a little flat, especially in the distant tree line around the tower.  A light burn and some contrast boost might help here a little.  All JMO of course.  :D  I like how you''ve incorporated the tree branches (foreground), and water grasses, to create some natural framing.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 08:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050002, 429147, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and well composed shot, but the trees and grass look too neatimage''d/noise-ninja''d</td>', 'Beautiful scene and well composed shot, but the trees and grass look too neatimage''d/noise-ninja''d', '2006-11-21 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050005, 428397, 48954, '<td valign="top">Arti-Elvi you live in Kijkduin so has got to be yours. If this is in fact your shot, i will be in Hollande in a few weeks. Not sure when yet, but i''ll let you know. Kijduin is almost like my hometown...well not really but i remember it well.<br/> <br/>Good photo. A little dark for a postcard, but i like it nevertheless. 7</td>', 'Arti-Elvi you live in Kijkduin so has got to be yours. If this is in fact your shot, i will be in Hollande in a few weeks. Not sure when yet, but i''ll let you know. Kijduin is almost like my hometown...well not really but i remember it well. Good photo. A little dark for a postcard, but i like it nevertheless. 7', '2006-11-21 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050007, 428676, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has a nice postcard feel to it.  Clean, crisp, and interesting to look at.  The strong lighting works overall, it does seem a little hot on the right rocking chair perhaps, but that''s a minor issue in the big scheme of things here.  :D  I do get the impression you were timid on placing text on this nice photo?  Personally, I would have maybe gone a little larger on the text (I like the font style BTW), and spread it out some, maybe even split the message into two parts; "Shaker Village" and then "Pleasant Hill, Kentucky".  Something like that.  All JMO of course.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has a nice postcard feel to it.  Clean, crisp, and interesting to look at.  The strong lighting works overall, it does seem a little hot on the right rocking chair perhaps, but that''s a minor issue in the big scheme of things here.  :D  I do get the impression you were timid on placing text on this nice photo?  Personally, I would have maybe gone a little larger on the text (I like the font style BTW), and spread it out some, maybe even split the message into two parts; "Shaker Village" and then "Pleasant Hill, Kentucky".  Something like that.  All JMO of course.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050009, 429076, 48954, '<td valign="top">good composition.</td>', 'good composition.', '2006-11-21 08:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050011, 428537, 7485, '<td valign="top">Hey, unfair, my city didn''t have any fireworks this week! Very nicely caught and well composed. I just wish the darks were darker, to really give the city lights and fireworks full contrast. In particular, even the darkest parts of the sky still look grayish-brown on my display, rather than jet-black.</td>', 'Hey, unfair, my city didn''t have any fireworks this week! Very nicely caught and well composed. I just wish the darks were darker, to really give the city lights and fireworks full contrast. In particular, even the darkest parts of the sky still look grayish-brown on my display, rather than jet-black.', '2006-11-21 08:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050013, 428777, 48954, '<td valign="top">a little heavy on the post processing i think.</td>', 'a little heavy on the post processing i think.', '2006-11-21 08:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050016, 428893, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Maybe a little soft, but I really like the way you''ve captured the sun as it falls/rises under/over the rocks (not sure if sunrise or sunset).  As for the postcard component of this challenge - why not place some text on the photograph?  Trying to sell the message in your title kind of defeats the special clause in this challenge IMO.  Again, that''s JMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Maybe a little soft, but I really like the way you''ve captured the sun as it falls/rises under/over the rocks (not sure if sunrise or sunset).  As for the postcard component of this challenge - why not place some text on the photograph?  Trying to sell the message in your title kind of defeats the special clause in this challenge IMO.  Again, that''s JMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050018, 428775, 7485, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the desaturated look works for this scene, I''d have gone either with full color or B&amp;W. Also the font is hard to read, it looks all jaggy.</td>', 'I''m not sure the desaturated look works for this scene, I''d have gone either with full color or B&W. Also the font is hard to read, it looks all jaggy.', '2006-11-21 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050019, 429339, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Here''s a winner.  Very clever idea with the colored text.  Works great with this very colorful subject you''ve chosen.  Great job!  I''d wish you luck in the challenge, but somehow don''t think you''re going to need it.  :D</td>', 'Hey!  Here''s a winner.  Very clever idea with the colored text.  Works great with this very colorful subject you''ve chosen.  Great job!  I''d wish you luck in the challenge, but somehow don''t think you''re going to need it.  :D', '2006-11-21 08:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050020, 429370, 48954, '<td valign="top">ackward crop. To tight for the buildings on the sides and the picture itself seems to be tipping overboard.</td>', 'ackward crop. To tight for the buildings on the sides and the picture itself seems to be tipping overboard.', '2006-11-21 08:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050021, 429237, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  The hillside and the two strong color tones in this work great together.  Very nice work putting this together and in your compositional choices.  Text for the postcard is "ok".  I like the font style selected - not sure I''m totally sold on the placement and size, but hey, we''re not graphic artists now are we?  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  The hillside and the two strong color tones in this work great together.  Very nice work putting this together and in your compositional choices.  Text for the postcard is "ok".  I like the font style selected - not sure I''m totally sold on the placement and size, but hey, we''re not graphic artists now are we?  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 08:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050023, 428743, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love the typewriter font!</td>', 'Love the typewriter font!', '2006-11-21 08:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050031, 428517, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great shot.</td>', 'LOL! Great shot.', '2006-11-21 08:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050055, 427413, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I know all too well what that winter is like (not that it''s much better here in Boston). You''ve captured all three in one frame, wind, snow, and darkness. Would be a 10 if the font didn''t have such obvious jaggies - 9</td>', 'Great idea! I know all too well what that winter is like (not that it''s much better here in Boston). You''ve captured all three in one frame, wind, snow, and darkness. Would be a 10 if the font didn''t have such obvious jaggies - 9', '2006-11-21 09:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050063, 428149, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors! I''d prefer less foreground, but on the other hand the house is nicely settled on the thirds lines.</td>', 'Excellent colors! I''d prefer less foreground, but on the other hand the house is nicely settled on the thirds lines.', '2006-11-21 09:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050078, 427671, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition, but find it a little too dark with too much lost detail.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition, but find it a little too dark with too much lost detail.', '2006-11-21 09:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050089, 428984, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool looking hay barn.  :D  Your postcard text matches up fine with the main subject and the theme.  Normally, a centered composition gets kind of hammered around here.  In this case it seems to work just fine.  Honestly, while the barn is cool, the surrounding area is a bit plain and ho-hum.  Nothing personal, just an observation, and certainly not much you can do (could have done) about it.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a cool looking hay barn.  :D  Your postcard text matches up fine with the main subject and the theme.  Normally, a centered composition gets kind of hammered around here.  In this case it seems to work just fine.  Honestly, while the barn is cool, the surrounding area is a bit plain and ho-hum.  Nothing personal, just an observation, and certainly not much you can do (could have done) about it.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 09:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050096, 429018, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun to look at photo.  At first I wanted to say that the postcard text is too small, but it actually works better in an understated manner.  The photo, while interesting, is a bit too grainy and blurry for me to be a strong image.  Clever use of it though for this challenge.  Hmmm.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun to look at photo.  At first I wanted to say that the postcard text is too small, but it actually works better in an understated manner.  The photo, while interesting, is a bit too grainy and blurry for me to be a strong image.  Clever use of it though for this challenge.  Hmmm.  Good luck.', '2006-11-21 09:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050098, 428977, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photograph and a perfect choice for a postcard.  That green roof really helps separate that church from the rest of skyline, and that sky is totally awesome.  I don''t think I''ve ever been to Lubeck, but you definitely got me missing Germany(visited family in Kassel a lot as a kid).  Great job, 10!</td>', 'Very beautiful photograph and a perfect choice for a postcard.  That green roof really helps separate that church from the rest of skyline, and that sky is totally awesome.  I don''t think I''ve ever been to Lubeck, but you definitely got me missing Germany(visited family in Kassel a lot as a kid).  Great job, 10!', '2006-11-21 09:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050109, 429417, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a postcard.  :D  Nice photo overall.  Pretty good control on perspective distortion (building lines while shooting with camera tilted up).  Font style selection is fine, although you could use more space for the text area up top as the "g" gets lost.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a postcard.  :D  Nice photo overall.  Pretty good control on perspective distortion (building lines while shooting with camera tilted up).  Font style selection is fine, although you could use more space for the text area up top as the "g" gets lost.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 09:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050112, 429045, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and photograph, a perfect example of a postcard photo.  Very nice job of adding text to this, it doesn''t overwhelm the photo like so many of the other entries.  Very nice, 10!</td>', 'Beautiful scene and photograph, a perfect example of a postcard photo.  Very nice job of adding text to this, it doesn''t overwhelm the photo like so many of the other entries.  Very nice, 10!', '2006-11-21 09:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050117, 428794, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute message. Strong photo, and obviously a good choice for your postcard theme.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute message. Strong photo, and obviously a good choice for your postcard theme.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 09:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050118, 428876, 61234, '<td valign="top">Very Clever S....! Striking image. Looks like a wonderful place to wander about and loose yourself.</td>', 'Very Clever S....! Striking image. Looks like a wonderful place to wander about and loose yourself.', '2006-11-21 09:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050119, 429277, 42100, '<td valign="top">I never tire of seeing this structure, it is really quite amazing.  As is this photo, beautiful light and color.  Great job, 10!</td>', 'I never tire of seeing this structure, it is really quite amazing.  As is this photo, beautiful light and color.  Great job, 10!', '2006-11-21 09:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050123, 428009, 42100, '<td valign="top">This by far has to be my top pick of the challenge, and there was some pretty damn good stuff entered.  The composition is very good and the monochromatic tones are just too awesome.  Also like the appropriate use of text, not all clunky like a lot of the others.  Excellent, 10!</td>', 'This by far has to be my top pick of the challenge, and there was some pretty damn good stuff entered.  The composition is very good and the monochromatic tones are just too awesome.  Also like the appropriate use of text, not all clunky like a lot of the others.  Excellent, 10!', '2006-11-21 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050133, 427809, 327, '<td valign="top">great color, dof, and over all feel. Exellent.</td>', 'great color, dof, and over all feel. Exellent.', '2006-11-21 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050138, 429076, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt to do something different for the art museum.  It''s fitting.</td>', 'I like the attempt to do something different for the art museum.  It''s fitting.', '2006-11-21 09:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050140, 429294, 42100, '<td valign="top">A simply amazing photograph, incredibly beautiful.  If you had gone one step further and done the complete postcard theme this would be a ten from me.  Of course, I do understand not wanting to ruin a photo this good.  Great job, 9!</td>', 'A simply amazing photograph, incredibly beautiful.  If you had gone one step further and done the complete postcard theme this would be a ten from me.  Of course, I do understand not wanting to ruin a photo this good.  Great job, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050141, 428928, 66193, '<td valign="top">i like it better with the top piece of wood cropped out, tighter to the top of the bonsai tree.  i especially like the textures in the background (wall)  very well done.  different from all the night shots.</td>', 'i like it better with the top piece of wood cropped out, tighter to the top of the bonsai tree.  i especially like the textures in the background (wall)  very well done.  different from all the night shots.', '2006-11-21 09:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050142, 428660, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photograph, I love that sky.  Great composition as well.  This is probably one of the few cases where I think the wide border works well(that is...on DPC, because of the samll image size allowed).  Very nice, 9!</td>', 'Very beautiful photograph, I love that sky.  Great composition as well.  This is probably one of the few cases where I think the wide border works well(that is...on DPC, because of the samll image size allowed).  Very nice, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050143, 429256, 42100, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photograph and great postcard design.  I really like this composition with the great sky interest.  Well done, 9!</td>', 'Gorgeous photograph and great postcard design.  I really like this composition with the great sky interest.  Well done, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050144, 428287, 66193, '<td valign="top">not exactly what I would call wildlife ;)  i like the silhouette treatment.</td>', 'not exactly what I would call wildlife ;)  i like the silhouette treatment.', '2006-11-21 09:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050146, 429304, 66193, '<td valign="top">very different.  I like it.</td>', 'very different.  I like it.', '2006-11-21 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050147, 429251, 66193, '<td valign="top">having the text in the postcard would have been better.  Nice B&amp;W shot, and the symmetrical composition works here.</td>', 'having the text in the postcard would have been better.  Nice B&W shot, and the symmetrical composition works here.', '2006-11-21 09:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050149, 429439, 66193, '<td valign="top">great perspective.  Not the usual vantage point.  well done.</td>', 'great perspective.  Not the usual vantage point.  well done.', '2006-11-21 09:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050151, 428765, 42100, '<td valign="top">Totally awesome composition, great job of including multiple landmarks without getting too busy of a photo.  Very good postcard finish as well.  Nicely done, 9!</td>', 'Totally awesome composition, great job of including multiple landmarks without getting too busy of a photo.  Very good postcard finish as well.  Nicely done, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050153, 428113, 66193, '<td valign="top">this one made me laugh.  and since I needed that this morning, I''m giving you an 8.  Original, witty, and a nice phot on top of that.</td>', 'this one made me laugh.  and since I needed that this morning, I''m giving you an 8.  Original, witty, and a nice phot on top of that.', '2006-11-21 09:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050156, 428537, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph, I think this one would roll out the doors of the souvenir shacks by the millions.  A little on the lite side though for the  tacky postcard processing that we''re typically used to seeing.  Great job, 9!</td>', 'Beautiful photograph, I think this one would roll out the doors of the souvenir shacks by the millions.  A little on the lite side though for the  tacky postcard processing that we''re typically used to seeing.  Great job, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050158, 427415, 66193, '<td valign="top">the sky looks overexposed.  A gradient ND filter would have been very useful here.  I like the witty text and originality.</td>', 'the sky looks overexposed.  A gradient ND filter would have been very useful here.  I like the witty text and originality.', '2006-11-21 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050160, 429326, 66193, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  The colors and lighting are fantastic, as well as the perspective.  giving it a 10.</td>', 'I love this one.  The colors and lighting are fantastic, as well as the perspective.  giving it a 10.', '2006-11-21 09:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050163, 428144, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the selective color, and the wide perspective.  Not sure of the vignetting, though.</td>', 'I like the selective color, and the wide perspective.  Not sure of the vignetting, though.', '2006-11-21 09:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050164, 429319, 66193, '<td valign="top">A little shadows work to show her eyes would have made this much better.  I like the colors, and the treatment.</td>', 'A little shadows work to show her eyes would have made this much better.  I like the colors, and the treatment.', '2006-11-21 09:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050165, 429094, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow!  That light is awesome and so is your photograph.  Beautifully composed.  This is a great postcard, but this reminds much more of the prints/posters that they sell next to the postcards in the tourist traps.  Well done, 9!</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow!  That light is awesome and so is your photograph.  Beautifully composed.  This is a great postcard, but this reminds much more of the prints/posters that they sell next to the postcards in the tourist traps.  Well done, 9!', '2006-11-21 09:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050166, 429229, 66193, '<td valign="top">now that''s different.  I like the collection of windmills.  very colorful.</td>', 'now that''s different.  I like the collection of windmills.  very colorful.', '2006-11-21 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050168, 428149, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice capture.  I would have cloned out the sign on the bottom right corner, though.</td>', 'very nice capture.  I would have cloned out the sign on the bottom right corner, though.', '2006-11-21 09:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050182, 429332, 31403, '<td valign="top">see how the M and O look like they are further apart from each other than the rest of the word?  in a real post card that would be kerned in so the "optical illusion" of kerning would be fixed.<br/> <br/>Photographically there seems to be too much black - the dark sections feel muddy to me.  A light touch of levels, curves, or shadow/highlight would really bring this to life.  I would also punch the cyans and add 8 to the hue to push them more to blue if this were my photo.<br/> <br/>Hope all that helps.  :-)  I''m envious of the beautiful place you live.</td>', 'see how the M and O look like they are further apart from each other than the rest of the word?  in a real post card that would be kerned in so the "optical illusion" of kerning would be fixed. Photographically there seems to be too much black - the dark sections feel muddy to me.  A light touch of levels, curves, or shadow/highlight would really bring this to life.  I would also punch the cyans and add 8 to the hue to push them more to blue if this were my photo. Hope all that helps.  :-)  I''m envious of the beautiful place you live.', '2006-11-21 09:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050194, 428547, 56978, '<td valign="top">I guess you''re not anticiapting a high score here...never mind</td>', 'I guess you''re not anticiapting a high score here...never mind', '2006-11-21 10:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050200, 429007, 56978, '<td valign="top">experimenting with HDR?  oversaturated and somehow flat at the same time, for me...</td>', 'experimenting with HDR?  oversaturated and somehow flat at the same time, for me...', '2006-11-21 10:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050213, 429262, 31403, '<td valign="top">a little color in the sky would make this a lot stronger IMO - like 45 minutes after sundown.  The black is very oppresive to the composition</td>', 'a little color in the sky would make this a lot stronger IMO - like 45 minutes after sundown.  The black is very oppresive to the composition', '2006-11-21 10:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050226, 429448, 31403, '<td valign="top">lotta black - shoot this 45 minutes after sundown (when the lights are on in the city, and balanced with the light levels in the sky) and that''s a postcard I''ll buy.  BTW, Pitt is one of my favorite cities, so it''s fun to see it even in the dark</td>', 'lotta black - shoot this 45 minutes after sundown (when the lights are on in the city, and balanced with the light levels in the sky) and that''s a postcard I''ll buy.  BTW, Pitt is one of my favorite cities, so it''s fun to see it even in the dark', '2006-11-21 10:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050238, 429233, 31403, '<td valign="top">shadows feel muddy to me - lightening these up in post would serve this photo well.<br/> <br/>The text is just oppressive - the postcard becomes a chunk of text decorated with a city - in other words my eye is pulled so strongly to the text it dillutes the entire image.<br/> <br/>Hope that''s helpful.</td>', 'shadows feel muddy to me - lightening these up in post would serve this photo well. The text is just oppressive - the postcard becomes a chunk of text decorated with a city - in other words my eye is pulled so strongly to the text it dillutes the entire image. Hope that''s helpful.', '2006-11-21 10:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050240, 427243, 31403, '<td valign="top">you obviously have eyes for something else, and you''re looking off frame at it.</td>', 'you obviously have eyes for something else, and you''re looking off frame at it.', '2006-11-21 10:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050250, 429439, 31403, '<td valign="top">very well done -</td>', 'very well done -', '2006-11-21 10:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050261, 428430, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 1<br/> <br/>Where is the color?<br/>The horizon is sadly out of skew.<br/>There''s no color.<br/>The copy is just silly - who would buy a post card that said that?<br/> <br/>Better luck in the next challenge.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 1 Where is the color?The horizon is sadly out of skew.There''s no color.The copy is just silly - who would buy a post card that said that? Better luck in the next challenge.', '2006-11-21 10:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050268, 428358, 31403, '<td valign="top">HDR?  The colors kind of have that feel.  I think this is very well done, and love the implementation of the font - it feels designed, a rarity in this challenge.</td>', 'HDR?  The colors kind of have that feel.  I think this is very well done, and love the implementation of the font - it feels designed, a rarity in this challenge.', '2006-11-21 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050271, 428692, 31403, '<td valign="top">bring out the detail in that statue in the foreground and I''ll give you a ten - great composition and I love the classic framing and font choice.  But my eye is drawn to the sun instead of anything "roma".</td>', 'bring out the detail in that statue in the foreground and I''ll give you a ten - great composition and I love the classic framing and font choice.  But my eye is drawn to the sun instead of anything "roma".', '2006-11-21 10:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050276, 428106, 31403, '<td valign="top">my what large fonts you have.<br/> <br/>Beautiful photo, love the way the white of the bridge draws your eye in.</td>', 'my what large fonts you have. Beautiful photo, love the way the white of the bridge draws your eye in.', '2006-11-21 10:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050282, 429416, 31403, '<td valign="top">it''s nice of that man to hold his hat up to keep that lady out of the rain.  At this low res she feels a little soft - but I''m going to guess she''s razor sharp in your original image.<br/> <br/>Nice work, it looks like a postcard.  If this is your original design, congrats on great work.  If it''s a copy of an existing postcard, good work there too.</td>', 'it''s nice of that man to hold his hat up to keep that lady out of the rain.  At this low res she feels a little soft - but I''m going to guess she''s razor sharp in your original image. Nice work, it looks like a postcard.  If this is your original design, congrats on great work.  If it''s a copy of an existing postcard, good work there too.', '2006-11-21 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050284, 428601, 31403, '<td valign="top">postcard with a spelling error - that''s very unfortunate.<br/> <br/>The people are a distraction to me - the title indicates we are looking at a beautiful building, but they are looking at pigeons.  I''d clone them out.  <br/> <br/>6 - 2 for spelling - 4</td>', 'postcard with a spelling error - that''s very unfortunate. The people are a distraction to me - the title indicates we are looking at a beautiful building, but they are looking at pigeons.  I''d clone them out.   6 - 2 for spelling - 4', '2006-11-21 10:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050314, 429256, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great capture and the font is perfect. Looks just like a postcard. 8</td>', 'Great capture and the font is perfect. Looks just like a postcard. 8', '2006-11-21 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050318, 429326, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective with the bench aas the grounding force. Good job. 8</td>', 'I love the perspective with the bench aas the grounding force. Good job. 8', '2006-11-21 10:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050319, 429045, 15711, '<td valign="top">THAT''s lovely and certainly looks like a postcard!</td>', 'THAT''s lovely and certainly looks like a postcard!', '2006-11-21 10:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050320, 428765, 66193, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!  What a great vantage point.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen this view before.  giving it a 10.</td>', 'Fantastic!!  What a great vantage point.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen this view before.  giving it a 10.', '2006-11-21 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050324, 429438, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and oversaturation of colors.</td>', 'I like the perspective and oversaturation of colors.', '2006-11-21 10:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050327, 429426, 66193, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  I like the B&amp;W treatment.  A little different from the typical ivy covered walls.</td>', 'nicely done.  I like the B&W treatment.  A little different from the typical ivy covered walls.', '2006-11-21 10:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050329, 429277, 66193, '<td valign="top">a timeless classic view.  I especially like the moon in the shot.  starting it off with a 9.</td>', 'a timeless classic view.  I especially like the moon in the shot.  starting it off with a 9.', '2006-11-21 10:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050334, 429344, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like this one. I''d also like to see the others in the series.</td>', 'I like this one. I''d also like to see the others in the series.', '2006-11-21 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050339, 429220, 66193, '<td valign="top">isn''t Antarctica in the south?</td>', 'isn''t Antarctica in the south?', '2006-11-21 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050341, 427243, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice image and treatment.  Not sure how it''s a postcard though.</td>', 'nice image and treatment.  Not sure how it''s a postcard though.', '2006-11-21 10:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050345, 429438, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice POV.  something about it, however, looks over-processed to me.</td>', 'nice POV.  something about it, however, looks over-processed to me.', '2006-11-21 10:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050349, 428430, 66193, '<td valign="top">completely washed out, I''m falling over, and boring all around.  was this supposed to be making a point?</td>', 'completely washed out, I''m falling over, and boring all around.  was this supposed to be making a point?', '2006-11-21 10:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050350, 427215, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice colors and composition.  maybe a slight color cast in the sky.  not sure about the wildlife, though.</td>', 'nice colors and composition.  maybe a slight color cast in the sky.  not sure about the wildlife, though.', '2006-11-21 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050354, 428676, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the way it plays against the starkness of the furniture.  I don''t like the font, however.  It doesn''t work with the image.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the way it plays against the starkness of the furniture.  I don''t like the font, however.  It doesn''t work with the image.', '2006-11-21 10:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050355, 429294, 38032, '<td valign="top">THat just draws in the eye.  Wowsers - magical.  I understand why you chose no type!</td>', 'THat just draws in the eye.  Wowsers - magical.  I understand why you chose no type!', '2006-11-21 10:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050360, 429237, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice image.</td>', 'nice image.', '2006-11-21 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050361, 429417, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, with the contrasting red.  Might be cropped a little tight on top for me.  but nicely done.</td>', 'I like the colors, with the contrasting red.  Might be cropped a little tight on top for me.  but nicely done.', '2006-11-21 10:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050363, 429265, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little muted in the color.  More contrast and saturation would have made this image pop.</td>', 'a little muted in the color.  More contrast and saturation would have made this image pop.', '2006-11-21 11:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050400, 429043, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture,</td>', 'nice capture,', '2006-11-21 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050405, 428009, 66193, '<td valign="top">love the blue treatment!  makes it stand out above all the other night shots.</td>', 'love the blue treatment!  makes it stand out above all the other night shots.', '2006-11-21 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050412, 428777, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks like a heavy-handed application of shadows recovery.</td>', 'looks like a heavy-handed application of shadows recovery.', '2006-11-21 11:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050445, 429267, 30049, '<td valign="top">The pelican is alright as a subject.  Looks like some detail has been lost in the white areas of the bird either from overexposing or pushing the contrast too high perhaps.  The pelican seems to be in focus just fine, but the photo overall seems oversharpened.  Positioning of your subject within the frame is good.  The text message is "ok".  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The pelican is alright as a subject.  Looks like some detail has been lost in the white areas of the bird either from overexposing or pushing the contrast too high perhaps.  The pelican seems to be in focus just fine, but the photo overall seems oversharpened.  Positioning of your subject within the frame is good.  The text message is "ok".  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050455, 427970, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean, interesting image.  You can tell there''s a little time lapse (long exposure) by looking at the water, which has a nice blur to it.  Text is fine.  Now that I''m looking a little closer I wonder if it''s not just a smidgen overexposed?  I say that because the text on some of the signs is blurring together (BELLSOUTH, building in the center also).  Just an observation.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice, clean, interesting image.  You can tell there''s a little time lapse (long exposure) by looking at the water, which has a nice blur to it.  Text is fine.  Now that I''m looking a little closer I wonder if it''s not just a smidgen overexposed?  I say that because the text on some of the signs is blurring together (BELLSOUTH, building in the center also).  Just an observation.  Overall, well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 11:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050462, 428012, 30049, '<td valign="top">I understand that this was probably a "moment" captured as the surfers were leaving.  It''s a shame that the blownout sun had to be included in this as the rest of the image looks nice overall.  Could be sharpened maybe just a little.  In this challenge the photographers were given artistic license with a rule exception allowing text.  It wasn''t required, but I can''t help but wonder why you didn''t give it a shot?  Just an observation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I understand that this was probably a "moment" captured as the surfers were leaving.  It''s a shame that the blownout sun had to be included in this as the rest of the image looks nice overall.  Could be sharpened maybe just a little.  In this challenge the photographers were given artistic license with a rule exception allowing text.  It wasn''t required, but I can''t help but wonder why you didn''t give it a shot?  Just an observation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-21 11:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050465, 428481, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would have either not included the text in the top left corner or put it in a more readable color. As it is the text actual detracts from the image.</td>', 'I would have either not included the text in the top left corner or put it in a more readable color. As it is the text actual detracts from the image.', '2006-11-21 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050486, 428009, 56978, '<td valign="top">aah, that beats my similar view...great shot!</td>', 'aah, that beats my similar view...great shot!', '2006-11-21 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3050492, 429202, 56978, '<td valign="top">too much dead space, not enough of the castle...</td>', 'too much dead space, not enough of the castle...', '2006-11-21 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1);
