(3051410, 427809, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like the way the pier leads out with the skyline in the background.  The blue tones are nice too, and help give the feel of a dreary day.  Unfortunately, I would have rather seen this in something like a "rain" challenge.  It just seems so sad and depressing, and makes me want to stay away from Seattle.  The text also seems just thrown on.  I think I might have liked to see it lower to the bottom of the postcard, and a different font.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like the way the pier leads out with the skyline in the background.  The blue tones are nice too, and help give the feel of a dreary day.  Unfortunately, I would have rather seen this in something like a "rain" challenge.  It just seems so sad and depressing, and makes me want to stay away from Seattle.  The text also seems just thrown on.  I think I might have liked to see it lower to the bottom of the postcard, and a different font.', '2006-11-21 17:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051414, 429294, 51538, '<td valign="top">You have my number 1 vote for this contest; my only 10.  Certainly the image is better for the sake of having no text.  But overall it is a very seasonal view and exquisitely beautiful. In Iceland you certainly have some lovely vistas.  But even better, there are some talented photographers to relay them to those of us who are too far away to see them first hand.  Well done and season''s greetings.</td>', 'You have my number 1 vote for this contest; my only 10.  Certainly the image is better for the sake of having no text.  But overall it is a very seasonal view and exquisitely beautiful. In Iceland you certainly have some lovely vistas.  But even better, there are some talented photographers to relay them to those of us who are too far away to see them first hand.  Well done and season''s greetings.', '2006-11-21 17:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
