(3051461, 429433, 47852, '<td valign="top">Looks like the same thing I''d see all over the country.  It''s a cute shot, but I think with postcards, I''d prefer to see something that stands out as being unique to the area.  Taken out of the postcard context though, it''s still a great photo, and I love the bokeh in this one.</td>', 'Looks like the same thing I''d see all over the country.  It''s a cute shot, but I think with postcards, I''d prefer to see something that stands out as being unique to the area.  Taken out of the postcard context though, it''s still a great photo, and I love the bokeh in this one.', '2006-11-21 17:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051465, 428765, 41794, '<td valign="top">Very unique take on some oft photographed architecture. I like how you were able to combine all three into one shot. Looks a little strange to have the Washington monument cut-off, but I still think it looks great. Composition nicely leads my eye from left to right.</td>', 'Very unique take on some oft photographed architecture. I like how you were able to combine all three into one shot. Looks a little strange to have the Washington monument cut-off, but I still think it looks great. Composition nicely leads my eye from left to right.', '2006-11-21 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
