(3051476, 429199, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice crop</td>', 'nice crop', '2006-11-21 17:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051478, 429246, 47852, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful coloring, and a great shot with the star trails.  I wish there were text here though to give it more of that postcard feel, and to share where this fantastic view can be seen.</td>', 'Simply beautiful coloring, and a great shot with the star trails.  I wish there were text here though to give it more of that postcard feel, and to share where this fantastic view can be seen.', '2006-11-21 17:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051482, 429365, 47852, '<td valign="top">The towers (especialy the tops) look like huge ears of corn from this angle :P  I like the placement of the text, but it seems very small in relation to the whole composition.  Perhaps just "Chicago" in a larger font would have worked?</td>', 'The towers (especialy the tops) look like huge ears of corn from this angle :P  I like the placement of the text, but it seems very small in relation to the whole composition.  Perhaps just "Chicago" in a larger font would have worked?', '2006-11-21 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051483, 429250, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice colors ! depending on which side of the bed you wake up on can help make a decision on which bridge to take across the water !</td>', 'nice colors ! depending on which side of the bed you wake up on can help make a decision on which bridge to take across the water !', '2006-11-21 17:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051488, 428866, 31637, '<td valign="top">too dark, try to keep cam around ambient light when taking a long expsoure. Or try dropping shutter speeds to at least 20 seconds .</td>', 'too dark, try to keep cam around ambient light when taking a long expsoure. Or try dropping shutter speeds to at least 20 seconds .', '2006-11-21 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051489, 429412, 31637, '<td valign="top">full of character these meerkats or lemurs. Clear but could be clearer.</td>', 'full of character these meerkats or lemurs. Clear but could be clearer.', '2006-11-21 18:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051493, 429370, 31637, '<td valign="top">bad alignment. Try a different angle . Tall sears tower looks like its left out.</td>', 'bad alignment. Try a different angle . Tall sears tower looks like its left out.', '2006-11-21 18:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051494, 428840, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice shot..but for a postcard?</td>', 'nice shot..but for a postcard?', '2006-11-21 18:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051495, 429421, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m having a very difficult time reading the text, since it''s small and also a more whimsical font.  I like the idea of the top to bottom text though, that is a unique twist.  I''m also not sure what the photo has to do with the location (since I can''t tell what the location is), but there is definately an interesting sky in there!</td>', 'I''m having a very difficult time reading the text, since it''s small and also a more whimsical font.  I like the idea of the top to bottom text though, that is a unique twist.  I''m also not sure what the photo has to do with the location (since I can''t tell what the location is), but there is definately an interesting sky in there!', '2006-11-21 18:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051496, 428413, 31637, '<td valign="top">whoa. They look like toy robots that you wind up!</td>', 'whoa. They look like toy robots that you wind up!', '2006-11-21 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051498, 427818, 31637, '<td valign="top">little dark here. Good postcard though..could be better.</td>', 'little dark here. Good postcard though..could be better.', '2006-11-21 18:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051525, 429439, 42013, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is perfect. The bridge has a nice even color and the city behind is not overpowering yet it is an integral part of the picture. Good luck.</td>', 'The lighting on this is perfect. The bridge has a nice even color and the city behind is not overpowering yet it is an integral part of the picture. Good luck.', '2006-11-21 18:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051548, 427333, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome message.</td>', 'Awesome message.', '2006-11-21 18:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051566, 429294, 61234, '<td valign="top">When I saw this, my breathing literally stopped. This is AMAZING. This must be the picture that someone in the forum mentioned as the best picture they had ever seen on DPC: and boy, were they right. If this, however, is not the aforementioned image, that''s ok too, as it is one of the most incredible images I have had the pleasure of seeing. Now I know why I love DPC. It is witnessing a gem like this pop up on the screen unexpectedly. which takes your breath away. Oh, by the way, this is going home with the blue!<br/>Thank you so much for sharing it with us. A visual inspiration indeed! Oh, and this is deserving of nothing LESS than a 10 (in my book).</td>', 'When I saw this, my breathing literally stopped. This is AMAZING. This must be the picture that someone in the forum mentioned as the best picture they had ever seen on DPC: and boy, were they right. If this, however, is not the aforementioned image, that''s ok too, as it is one of the most incredible images I have had the pleasure of seeing. Now I know why I love DPC. It is witnessing a gem like this pop up on the screen unexpectedly. which takes your breath away. Oh, by the way, this is going home with the blue!Thank you so much for sharing it with us. A visual inspiration indeed! Oh, and this is deserving of nothing LESS than a 10 (in my book).', '2006-11-21 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051567, 429277, 61234, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image. Perfect lighting and tones. Should do very well.</td>', 'Exceptional image. Perfect lighting and tones. Should do very well.', '2006-11-21 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051569, 428765, 61234, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Very nice job overall. Should place high.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Very nice job overall. Should place high.', '2006-11-21 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051570, 429045, 61234, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.</td>', 'Excellent work.', '2006-11-21 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051572, 428619, 61234, '<td valign="top">Love the tones you employed here. This must be one of the nicest times of year to explore the seashore with its golden and rust hues. Oh, and not tons of tourist to contend with. What an amazing sky. I''m sure this will do very well.</td>', 'Love the tones you employed here. This must be one of the nicest times of year to explore the seashore with its golden and rust hues. Oh, and not tons of tourist to contend with. What an amazing sky. I''m sure this will do very well.', '2006-11-21 18:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051573, 428342, 61234, '<td valign="top">Big points for something different and original. Thanks for mixing things up a bit.</td>', 'Big points for something different and original. Thanks for mixing things up a bit.', '2006-11-21 18:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051574, 429326, 61234, '<td valign="top">Very striking and professional. Perfect on all levels. I look forward to seeing this do very well. Congrats on a first-rate image for this project!</td>', 'Very striking and professional. Perfect on all levels. I look forward to seeing this do very well. Congrats on a first-rate image for this project!', '2006-11-21 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051575, 428972, 19474, '<td valign="top">you need to have a look at your white balance as this has a strong blue cast and needs to be sharper<br/>but I like the scene and it would make a good postcard with a little more editing</td>', 'you need to have a look at your white balance as this has a strong blue cast and needs to be sharperbut I like the scene and it would make a good postcard with a little more editing', '2006-11-21 18:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051576, 428009, 61234, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite postcards. I like the steely monotone look you''ve achieved here. A stand-out for sure.</td>', 'One of my favorite postcards. I like the steely monotone look you''ve achieved here. A stand-out for sure.', '2006-11-21 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051582, 429084, 61234, '<td valign="top">Hello fellow Rhode Islander (I assume); maybe I should rephrase to ''visitor''. Trying to figure out where this was taken. Beach Pond, Goddard Park, or up north somewhere. At any rate, well done.<br/>Love the happy wispy little clouds. They add alot to this peaceful setting. Good luck!</td>', 'Hello fellow Rhode Islander (I assume); maybe I should rephrase to ''visitor''. Trying to figure out where this was taken. Beach Pond, Goddard Park, or up north somewhere. At any rate, well done.Love the happy wispy little clouds. They add alot to this peaceful setting. Good luck!', '2006-11-21 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051584, 428802, 61234, '<td valign="top">Hello another fellow Rhode Islander. Considering it''s the smallest state, Rhode Island did pretty well for itself in this challenge. You''ve done a fine job showcasing one of its gems. The script works well. Very nice job indeed!</td>', 'Hello another fellow Rhode Islander. Considering it''s the smallest state, Rhode Island did pretty well for itself in this challenge. You''ve done a fine job showcasing one of its gems. The script works well. Very nice job indeed!', '2006-11-21 18:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051585, 428928, 61234, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite postcards. Nicely executed on all levels.</td>', 'One of my favorite postcards. Nicely executed on all levels.', '2006-11-21 18:52:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3051601, 427657, 40797, '<td valign="top">Great post card!! I like the font that you used on this!</td>', 'Great post card!! I like the font that you used on this!', '2006-11-21 18:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051606, 428342, 19474, '<td valign="top">you need to take your clothes off earlier as you have a VPL <i>visible panty line</i>... any excuse to show of a great body should be encouraged :)<br/>this would sell well as a post card but I would use a diifferant font as the bottom line reads as <i>But the view to great!</i></td>', 'you need to take your clothes off earlier as you have a VPL visible panty line... any excuse to show of a great body should be encouraged :)this would sell well as a post card but I would use a diifferant font as the bottom line reads as But the view to great!', '2006-11-21 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051619, 428950, 19474, '<td valign="top">been there done that :)<br/>nice colors and composition but needs to be a little sharper   7</td>', 'been there done that :)nice colors and composition but needs to be a little sharper   7', '2006-11-21 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051625, 429319, 19474, '<td valign="top">great postcard but I think you will fall fowl of the editing rules but an 8 for now</td>', 'great postcard but I think you will fall fowl of the editing rules but an 8 for now', '2006-11-21 19:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051630, 429229, 19474, '<td valign="top">this is such a quirky photo it would do real well as a postcard<br/>I love it and it is my top pick 10+</td>', 'this is such a quirky photo it would do real well as a postcardI love it and it is my top pick 10+', '2006-11-21 19:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051636, 428794, 19474, '<td valign="top">I hope for your sake that the rest of the world understands the importance of sheep to us Kiwi''s... a great shot</td>', 'I hope for your sake that the rest of the world understands the importance of sheep to us Kiwi''s... a great shot', '2006-11-21 19:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051692, 429256, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love the colors in the sky, the smoothness of the water, the detail in the buildings. The way you rendered the San Francisco text makes it feel like it is resisting the wind that is blowing the clouds across the sky. The serene water and city skyline seem to be a contrast to what appears to be a windy sky, perhaps the remnants of an afternoon storm. A great postcard!!</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love the colors in the sky, the smoothness of the water, the detail in the buildings. The way you rendered the San Francisco text makes it feel like it is resisting the wind that is blowing the clouds across the sky. The serene water and city skyline seem to be a contrast to what appears to be a windy sky, perhaps the remnants of an afternoon storm. A great postcard!!', '2006-11-21 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051740, 429303, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - good clarity and focus and color, but I really don''t see postcard</td>', 'Very nice image - good clarity and focus and color, but I really don''t see postcard', '2006-11-21 20:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051742, 428144, 67152, '<td valign="top">The corns of the image really distract - although the rest of the image is great!</td>', 'The corns of the image really distract - although the rest of the image is great!', '2006-11-21 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051743, 428520, 67152, '<td valign="top">My oncly concern is that the horizon is right in the middle and the water in front does not add much to the really nice cityscape</td>', 'My oncly concern is that the horizon is right in the middle and the water in front does not add much to the really nice cityscape', '2006-11-21 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051744, 429409, 67152, '<td valign="top">well done postcard</td>', 'well done postcard', '2006-11-21 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051745, 429260, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice tokyo postcard - I could see buying this - and the text and font are right on the money</td>', 'nice tokyo postcard - I could see buying this - and the text and font are right on the money', '2006-11-21 20:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051747, 429332, 67152, '<td valign="top">very nice postcard - excellent font - very nice composition and colors</td>', 'very nice postcard - excellent font - very nice composition and colors', '2006-11-21 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051748, 429076, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent composition - very edgy and cool postcard for a cool place</td>', 'excellent composition - very edgy and cool postcard for a cool place', '2006-11-21 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051750, 428984, 67152, '<td valign="top">perfect use of a great barn for postcard - the font does not seem to quite fit however</td>', 'perfect use of a great barn for postcard - the font does not seem to quite fit however', '2006-11-21 20:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051753, 429444, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo and postcard - the ''gulf of mex'' text just has too much halo around it - otherwise just about perfect.</td>', 'Very cool photo and postcard - the ''gulf of mex'' text just has too much halo around it - otherwise just about perfect.', '2006-11-21 20:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051756, 429045, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent composition and use of text and font - great job</td>', 'excellent composition and use of text and font - great job', '2006-11-21 20:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051783, 429277, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great smooth image! Love the moon in the upper right.</td>', 'Great smooth image! Love the moon in the upper right.', '2006-11-21 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051787, 428811, 61191, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The text is too dominant and thus works distracting IMHO.</td>', 'Great shot! The text is too dominant and thus works distracting IMHO.', '2006-11-21 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051789, 429184, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice, VERY nice! Love the reflection and the lights in the background. Great job!</td>', 'Nice, VERY nice! Love the reflection and the lights in the background. Great job!', '2006-11-21 20:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051794, 428520, 47852, '<td valign="top">All of that negative space in the water is just screaming for some text!  I''m not sure I like the horizon right through the center, but with text added at the bottom, it might work.</td>', 'All of that negative space in the water is just screaming for some text!  I''m not sure I like the horizon right through the center, but with text added at the bottom, it might work.', '2006-11-21 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051796, 427333, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... looks very relaxing and peaceful.  My eye is drawn to the text at the bottom though, which is a bit wordy for such a serene and quiet place.</td>', 'Beautiful shot... looks very relaxing and peaceful.  My eye is drawn to the text at the bottom though, which is a bit wordy for such a serene and quiet place.', '2006-11-21 20:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051798, 429250, 47852, '<td valign="top">The negative space at the top is just calling out for some text to make this more postcard-like!  A lovely shot... it''s amazing how moving cars over a bridge can look so serene when it''s a long exposure!</td>', 'The negative space at the top is just calling out for some text to make this more postcard-like!  A lovely shot... it''s amazing how moving cars over a bridge can look so serene when it''s a long exposure!', '2006-11-21 20:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051800, 429370, 46046, '<td valign="top">different time of day would have helped this a lot</td>', 'different time of day would have helped this a lot', '2006-11-21 20:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051802, 427333, 67152, '<td valign="top">The photo is wonderful - but there is by far way to much text.  Welcome to the Coast would have been enough.</td>', 'The photo is wonderful - but there is by far way to much text.  Welcome to the Coast would have been enough.', '2006-11-21 20:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051803, 429059, 47852, '<td valign="top">A bit too much negative space for my tastes... the shopping center seems to get lost in the shrubbery at the bottom.  The text is also difficult to read on this one.  I think perhaps a bit tighter crop on the building with a slightly bigger font would work just a bit better for this one.</td>', 'A bit too much negative space for my tastes... the shopping center seems to get lost in the shrubbery at the bottom.  The text is also difficult to read on this one.  I think perhaps a bit tighter crop on the building with a slightly bigger font would work just a bit better for this one.', '2006-11-21 20:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051804, 429268, 67152, '<td valign="top">The photo is very good - the long exposure and the light from the building add a very nice dramatic effect.  I like the border and the top text - but the "westminster'' text with the comma seems a little too much</td>', 'The photo is very good - the long exposure and the light from the building add a very nice dramatic effect.  I like the border and the top text - but the "westminster'' text with the comma seems a little too much', '2006-11-21 20:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051806, 428859, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent use of text to complement a very nice picture - good composition, good color</td>', 'excellent use of text to complement a very nice picture - good composition, good color', '2006-11-21 20:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051807, 428666, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and great use of text and border to amplify the colors in the image</td>', 'Very nice photo and great use of text and border to amplify the colors in the image', '2006-11-21 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051813, 427767, 67152, '<td valign="top">A neat photo.  There is good color and decent lighting - but the text on the left of the screen does not fit with the text on the right</td>', 'A neat photo.  There is good color and decent lighting - but the text on the left of the screen does not fit with the text on the right', '2006-11-21 20:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051818, 429015, 67152, '<td valign="top">The photo is nice but the font and color don''t work real well</td>', 'The photo is nice but the font and color don''t work real well', '2006-11-21 21:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051820, 429059, 67152, '<td valign="top">too much negative space for a postcard</td>', 'too much negative space for a postcard', '2006-11-21 21:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051823, 429185, 67152, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a postcard in this photo - maybe I am missing the point of the photo</td>', 'I don''t see a postcard in this photo - maybe I am missing the point of the photo', '2006-11-21 21:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051825, 429094, 67152, '<td valign="top">amazing photo - excellent font, and perfect composition</td>', 'amazing photo - excellent font, and perfect composition', '2006-11-21 21:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051826, 428068, 67152, '<td valign="top">great composition and use of refelction</td>', 'great composition and use of refelction', '2006-11-21 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051827, 429256, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderful vibrant colors to bring out the sky and cityscape</td>', 'wonderful vibrant colors to bring out the sky and cityscape', '2006-11-21 21:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051828, 428995, 67152, '<td valign="top">a little dark for a postcard</td>', 'a little dark for a postcard', '2006-11-21 21:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
