(3053697, 429311, 56828, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo.  I would have liked to have seen the bench centered and more depth of field.  The path leads you to a bench that is out of focus.  You also should either capture all fo the arc or none of it.</td>', 'This is a good photo.  I would have liked to have seen the bench centered and more depth of field.  The path leads you to a bench that is out of focus.  You also should either capture all fo the arc or none of it.', '2006-11-22 08:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3053705, 429059, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think you have too much negative space at the top of your photo. And then the border cuts off even more of the subject you do have htere.  A little more depth of field would have also helped.</td>', 'I think you have too much negative space at the top of your photo. And then the border cuts off even more of the subject you do have htere.  A little more depth of field would have also helped.', '2006-11-22 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3053710, 428893, 56828, '<td valign="top">Increase your depth of field to get a sharper photo.  Great timing on the shot though.  Set up is great.</td>', 'Increase your depth of field to get a sharper photo.  Great timing on the shot though.  Set up is great.', '2006-11-22 08:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
