(3053722, 427805, 56828, '<td valign="top">This composition to this photo is great.  I just wish there were more depth of field to make the castle sharper.</td>', 'This composition to this photo is great.  I just wish there were more depth of field to make the castle sharper.', '2006-11-22 08:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
