(3054393, 429256, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wow, great image!  This one should be doing well!  I''d buy this postcard - nicely done! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Wow, great image!  This one should be doing well!  I''d buy this postcard - nicely done! <10>', '2006-11-22 12:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
