(3056963, 429438, 56400, '<td valign="top">I started off not liking this shot when I saw the BG focus was so soft, but the more I looked, I realized that it really works here. Everything on this side of the fence is clear and looks photographic. The other side of the fence is out of focus just enough to make it look like an illustration. Even the text has the same qualities, sharp on the bottom right and slightly soft on the upper left. Nice job.</td>', 'I started off not liking this shot when I saw the BG focus was so soft, but the more I looked, I realized that it really works here. Everything on this side of the fence is clear and looks photographic. The other side of the fence is out of focus just enough to make it look like an illustration. Even the text has the same qualities, sharp on the bottom right and slightly soft on the upper left. Nice job.', '2006-11-23 05:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056967, 429421, 56400, '<td valign="top">The text is hard to read. It needs a cleaner font.</td>', 'The text is hard to read. It needs a cleaner font.', '2006-11-23 05:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056978, 429068, 64928, '<td valign="top">Great picture! The lettering detracts rather than enhances...mayber a different font or placement.  9</td>', 'Great picture! The lettering detracts rather than enhances...mayber a different font or placement.  9', '2006-11-23 05:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056979, 428861, 56400, '<td valign="top">Cute, but your ''Texas'' looks like it lost a fight.</td>', 'Cute, but your ''Texas'' looks like it lost a fight.', '2006-11-23 05:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056985, 428149, 64928, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the light falls in this.  A little closer crop, cutting out a liitl of the darkness, works even better for me.</td>', 'I really like the way the light falls in this.  A little closer crop, cutting out a liitl of the darkness, works even better for me.', '2006-11-23 05:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056991, 429330, 56400, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but you need to get a shot of the dragon at the tip of Merritt Island (if it still exists anyway, I thought it was rebuilt several years ago)</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but you need to get a shot of the dragon at the tip of Merritt Island (if it still exists anyway, I thought it was rebuilt several years ago)', '2006-11-23 05:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056992, 429059, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but I would like to see more of the subject and less negative space.  The lettering is difficult to read.  Very nice colors on the photo.</td>', 'Very pretty, but I would like to see more of the subject and less negative space.  The lettering is difficult to read.  Very nice colors on the photo.', '2006-11-23 05:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3056996, 429227, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Almost makes me want to visit Kansas.  :)</td>', 'Very pretty.  Almost makes me want to visit Kansas.  :)', '2006-11-23 05:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057001, 428840, 61191, '<td valign="top">Funny take on the challenge - I like it.</td>', 'Funny take on the challenge - I like it.', '2006-11-23 05:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057002, 429233, 64928, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but this feels too cluttered for my taste. Is this a fish-eye lens? Almost makes me dizzy. :)</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but this feels too cluttered for my taste. Is this a fish-eye lens? Almost makes me dizzy. :)', '2006-11-23 05:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057003, 428889, 61191, '<td valign="top">The text works a bit distracting IMHO. But overall a great skyline shot!</td>', 'The text works a bit distracting IMHO. But overall a great skyline shot!', '2006-11-23 05:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057004, 429322, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very majestic; great color tones.</td>', 'Very majestic; great color tones.', '2006-11-23 05:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057006, 429418, 61191, '<td valign="top">Wow, the sky is REALLY amazing! Love your PP and the colors. I don''t like the yellow text: the color doesn''t fit.</td>', 'Wow, the sky is REALLY amazing! Love your PP and the colors. I don''t like the yellow text: the color doesn''t fit.', '2006-11-23 05:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057007, 428492, 64928, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountains.  I find the group of trees in the foreground distracting, but everything else is wonderful!</td>', 'Beautiful mountains.  I find the group of trees in the foreground distracting, but everything else is wonderful!', '2006-11-23 06:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057009, 429002, 61191, '<td valign="top">The green is too green IMHO. But overall a nice scandinavian countryshot, nicely composed, with good contrast.</td>', 'The green is too green IMHO. But overall a nice scandinavian countryshot, nicely composed, with good contrast.', '2006-11-23 06:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057010, 429221, 64928, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2006-11-23 06:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
