(3057031, 428413, 64928, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, but it leaves me wondering what is cropped off at the top.  My eyes follow the carpet and want to keep going up.  I realize you are probably emphazing the guards, but it just seems something is missing.  On the guards, I love the precision and the shadows!</td>', 'Nice clear shot, but it leaves me wondering what is cropped off at the top.  My eyes follow the carpet and want to keep going up.  I realize you are probably emphazing the guards, but it just seems something is missing.  On the guards, I love the precision and the shadows!', '2006-11-23 06:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057032, 429086, 64928, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place!</td>', 'What a beautiful place!', '2006-11-23 06:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
