(3057087, 429439, 64928, '<td valign="top">I like this because it''s not the Golden Gate you''ve seen a thousand times.</td>', 'I like this because it''s not the Golden Gate you''ve seen a thousand times.', '2006-11-23 06:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057090, 429140, 64928, '<td valign="top">Could be more in focus. Very nice colors in the sky.</td>', 'Could be more in focus. Very nice colors in the sky.', '2006-11-23 06:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057094, 429220, 64928, '<td valign="top">This looks like a postcard to me.  You captured the white in the snow w/o blowing it out and got so many shades of blue in the sky.  It''s a very pretty scene.</td>', 'This looks like a postcard to me.  You captured the white in the snow w/o blowing it out and got so many shades of blue in the sky.  It''s a very pretty scene.', '2006-11-23 06:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057099, 428841, 64928, '<td valign="top">Too small for a postcard, but beautiful colors</td>', 'Too small for a postcard, but beautiful colors', '2006-11-23 06:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057100, 429330, 64928, '<td valign="top">This would make a beautiful card!</td>', 'This would make a beautiful card!', '2006-11-23 06:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057102, 429187, 64928, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors, but nothing really to focus on.</td>', 'Nice fall colors, but nothing really to focus on.', '2006-11-23 07:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057123, 429277, 64928, '<td valign="top">This would make a beautiful postcard! Ribbon material in my book.</td>', 'This would make a beautiful postcard! Ribbon material in my book.', '2006-11-23 07:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057161, 429311, 12611, '<td valign="top">I Like the lines but the color scheme and the compostion are not too snappy, certainly not for a postcard. A botanical garden postcard should be a lot more foliage and plants, not 80% brick. I do dig how your eyes are led to the empty bench. Put a person there and you change the whole shot.</td>', 'I Like the lines but the color scheme and the compostion are not too snappy, certainly not for a postcard. A botanical garden postcard should be a lot more foliage and plants, not 80% brick. I do dig how your eyes are led to the empty bench. Put a person there and you change the whole shot.', '2006-11-23 08:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057166, 427801, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great shot, horrendously unprofessional, and cropped pretty bad. But you have a beautiful country.</td>', 'Great shot, horrendously unprofessional, and cropped pretty bad. But you have a beautiful country.', '2006-11-23 08:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057168, 427215, 12611, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. THe colors, tones and tree limbs are perfect. Lose the title and retitle it Autumn in Japan. Wildlife typically means animals. Still its awesome.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. THe colors, tones and tree limbs are perfect. Lose the title and retitle it Autumn in Japan. Wildlife typically means animals. Still its awesome.', '2006-11-23 08:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057170, 429291, 12611, '<td valign="top">Terrific. make this a print. great values here between the light sky, gray middle and deep blue. good work.</td>', 'Terrific. make this a print. great values here between the light sky, gray middle and deep blue. good work.', '2006-11-23 08:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057174, 429094, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful; very rich but a tad dark in values for my taste.</td>', 'Beautiful; very rich but a tad dark in values for my taste.', '2006-11-23 08:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057177, 428009, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and I love the wow chrome letters, perhaps a bit thicker would work. fantastic negative space with a dark blue gradient. cheers.</td>', 'Beautiful and I love the wow chrome letters, perhaps a bit thicker would work. fantastic negative space with a dark blue gradient. cheers.', '2006-11-23 08:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057179, 429186, 12611, '<td valign="top">Youv''e done the fantastically impossible; you''ve made me want to go to minneapolis, just kidding, but seriously- you have the wow factor knocked tight. great color variations as well. nice job.</td>', 'Youv''e done the fantastically impossible; you''ve made me want to go to minneapolis, just kidding, but seriously- you have the wow factor knocked tight. great color variations as well. nice job.', '2006-11-23 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057181, 429046, 12611, '<td valign="top">Didn''t they name a coffee after this? Its a bit dark, and the aspect ratio is a touch off, but I like the deep colors and the inclusion of the bridge, high marks on this one.</td>', 'Didn''t they name a coffee after this? Its a bit dark, and the aspect ratio is a touch off, but I like the deep colors and the inclusion of the bridge, high marks on this one.', '2006-11-23 08:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057185, 429233, 12611, '<td valign="top">A touch busy, but after a minute or so I like the frenetic fish eye type feel.  I applaud the saturated red and blues.</td>', 'A touch busy, but after a minute or so I like the frenetic fish eye type feel.  I applaud the saturated red and blues.', '2006-11-23 08:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057187, 428802, 12611, '<td valign="top">terrific. imposing, awesome. I can taste the Aunt Carrie''s belly bomb clam cakes just looking at this. Great postcard.</td>', 'terrific. imposing, awesome. I can taste the Aunt Carrie''s belly bomb clam cakes just looking at this. Great postcard.', '2006-11-23 08:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057193, 429297, 12611, '<td valign="top">Serene, majestic, beautiful feel to this. I love it. Great work, and nice light feel to this.</td>', 'Serene, majestic, beautiful feel to this. I love it. Great work, and nice light feel to this.', '2006-11-23 08:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057195, 428977, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome color and tone; but the crop and black border are ill advised.</td>', 'Awesome color and tone; but the crop and black border are ill advised.', '2006-11-23 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057204, 429221, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and sky; nice tones. really nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful light and sky; nice tones. really nice work.', '2006-11-23 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057404, 429082, 22781, '<td valign="top">Een MOLEN altijd mooi...</td>', 'Een MOLEN altijd mooi...', '2006-11-23 10:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057464, 429294, 40355, '<td valign="top">Truly one of the most amazing photos I have ever seen!  Amazing colors and scenery, great composition and exposure.  10</td>', 'Truly one of the most amazing photos I have ever seen!  Amazing colors and scenery, great composition and exposure.  10', '2006-11-23 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057475, 428876, 29177, '<td valign="top">Now that phrase is just great!! I got quite a chuckle out of that one! Beautiful shot... *still laughing*</td>', 'Now that phrase is just great!! I got quite a chuckle out of that one! Beautiful shot... *still laughing*', '2006-11-23 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057476, 429185, 67258, '<td valign="top">Weird - I can''t work out what I am looking at.  The photo doesn''t seem to meet the challenge, at least on the face of it.<br/>Edit - On reflection my earlier comment seems a bit harsh - I still can''t work out what the photo is of (a cross between lips and translucent underwater slugs...?), but it is strangely hypnotic.  As a postcard that is a souvenir, I feel it doesn''t really work, but think it might be better without the text, just as a standard card.</td>', 'Weird - I can''t work out what I am looking at.  The photo doesn''t seem to meet the challenge, at least on the face of it.Edit - On reflection my earlier comment seems a bit harsh - I still can''t work out what the photo is of (a cross between lips and translucent underwater slugs...?), but it is strangely hypnotic.  As a postcard that is a souvenir, I feel it doesn''t really work, but think it might be better without the text, just as a standard card.', '2006-11-23 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057536, 429163, 56167, '<td valign="top">nice focus and colours well done</td>', 'nice focus and colours well done', '2006-11-23 12:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3057538, 429221, 56167, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-11-23 12:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
