(3057595, 427663, 32321, '<td valign="top">I find this image very dark, and (I assume the birds) are very distracting. This would not be my choice if it was on a rack with other cards</td>', 'I find this image very dark, and (I assume the birds) are very distracting. This would not be my choice if it was on a rack with other cards', '2006-11-23 12:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
