(3058695, 429294, 46046, '<td valign="top">how much manipulation.........?   really curious.......wonderful, interesting image!  my guess is this will ribbon....nice comp if a little flat........nice work!</td>', 'how much manipulation.........?   really curious.......wonderful, interesting image!  my guess is this will ribbon....nice comp if a little flat........nice work!', '2006-11-24 00:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058723, 429294, 64446, '<td valign="top">Wow...<br/> <br/>That''s not fair competition with you guys having such scenary to shoot - it is not even funny! :-). OK, I think you have to get out and endure some little cold too, so all is even.<br/> <br/>Terrific image: I wish there was less road there (cropped the bottom an inch more), but what do I know and who really cares? I can lift the eyes just a bit and enjoy the scene.</td>', 'Wow... That''s not fair competition with you guys having such scenary to shoot - it is not even funny! :-). OK, I think you have to get out and endure some little cold too, so all is even. Terrific image: I wish there was less road there (cropped the bottom an inch more), but what do I know and who really cares? I can lift the eyes just a bit and enjoy the scene.', '2006-11-24 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058727, 429313, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice purple skies and water reflection. Building lights seem a bit noiser, though.<br/>Nevertheless, a very nice composition and well titled, worthwile of the city it portraits.</td>', 'Nice purple skies and water reflection. Building lights seem a bit noiser, though.Nevertheless, a very nice composition and well titled, worthwile of the city it portraits.', '2006-11-24 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058749, 429421, 60862, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture, but if you''re going to put text on the postcard, be sure it''s easily read.  I can''t tell what the last word is.</td>', 'Pretty picture, but if you''re going to put text on the postcard, be sure it''s easily read.  I can''t tell what the last word is.', '2006-11-24 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058750, 427700, 60862, '<td valign="top">Part of the visual interest for me in a cityscape like this is the individual shapes and patterns, and blurriness reduces that.</td>', 'Part of the visual interest for me in a cityscape like this is the individual shapes and patterns, and blurriness reduces that.', '2006-11-24 01:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058752, 428398, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what the subject is.</td>', 'Not really sure what the subject is.', '2006-11-24 01:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058753, 428413, 60862, '<td valign="top">Kind of washed out, although it''s great how you captured them in mid-stride, and the shadows are very interesting.</td>', 'Kind of washed out, although it''s great how you captured them in mid-stride, and the shadows are very interesting.', '2006-11-24 01:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058754, 428520, 60862, '<td valign="top">Using half of the shot for the smooth water gives up a lot of visual interest, at least for me.</td>', 'Using half of the shot for the smooth water gives up a lot of visual interest, at least for me.', '2006-11-24 01:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058755, 429356, 60862, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a yellow cast to your colors.  Or maybe it''s just not enough contrast.</td>', 'Seems to be a yellow cast to your colors.  Or maybe it''s just not enough contrast.', '2006-11-24 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058757, 428972, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened to the stuff in the bottom 1/3, but it looks almost like a painting.  Did you sharpen this a lot?</td>', 'Not sure what happened to the stuff in the bottom 1/3, but it looks almost like a painting.  Did you sharpen this a lot?', '2006-11-24 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
