(3058814, 429199, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Your title nails it!</b>  However, the muted tones of the landscape don''t quite sell the cartoonish nature of your premise.  IMHO brightly satured colors &amp; slightly askew aspect (Free-Form Skew setting in which the top two corners are pulled up &amp; out of the frame) would certainly "scream" tacky-ness.  But <b>that</b> suggestion was not intended for a challenge since that much artistic effect doesn''t score points on DPC.  Yet <b>I</b> like it!  :)</td>', 'Your title nails it!  However, the muted tones of the landscape don''t quite sell the cartoonish nature of your premise.  IMHO brightly satured colors & slightly askew aspect (Free-Form Skew setting in which the top two corners are pulled up & out of the frame) would certainly "scream" tacky-ness.  But that suggestion was not intended for a challenge since that much artistic effect doesn''t score points on DPC.  Yet I like it!  :)', '2006-11-24 02:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3058816, 429072, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great photo in Sepiatone!  Oh, by the way, if you''re a <b>Good Sport</b> with a good sense of humor, please consider sending a copy of this photo (title and all) to <a href="https://www.craptography.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.craptography.com</a> ...The name alone is worth the price of admission!  :}</td>', 'Great photo in Sepiatone!  Oh, by the way, if you''re a Good Sport with a good sense of humor, please consider sending a copy of this photo (title and all) to www.craptography.com ...The name alone is worth the price of admission!  :}', '2006-11-24 02:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
