(3059319, 429055, 56167, '<td valign="top">I have seen this building often but you have managed to capture it to make it look better than it is, well done</td>', 'I have seen this building often but you have managed to capture it to make it look better than it is, well done', '2006-11-24 09:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
