(3060216, 428115, 67841, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - but I''m usually bothered when dodging/burning is or even seems obvious.  I would have done my best to lighten the top of the foreground plant so that it was less apparent that I had darkened the sky.  I still give this one an 8!</td>', 'Lovely shot - but I''m usually bothered when dodging/burning is or even seems obvious.  I would have done my best to lighten the top of the foreground plant so that it was less apparent that I had darkened the sky.  I still give this one an 8!', '2006-11-24 18:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
