(3060251, 429220, 67841, '<td valign="top">God love those big lenses!  Love the composition but I can''t help but wish the colors would grab me more - 7</td>', 'God love those big lenses!  Love the composition but I can''t help but wish the colors would grab me more - 7', '2006-11-24 18:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060259, 429303, 67841, '<td valign="top">Love the colors &amp; composition, but it''s a bit overexposed &amp; the sky is blown out entirely - I know they''re expensive, but a graduated ND would have really helped in that regard.  Using some full ND to extend the exposure would have softened up the water cascades nicely which would have really added some depth to this one.  It''s worth doing over with the right tools or even trying several different exposures &amp; combining them with Photoshop to get the perfect composition.</td>', 'Love the colors & composition, but it''s a bit overexposed & the sky is blown out entirely - I know they''re expensive, but a graduated ND would have really helped in that regard.  Using some full ND to extend the exposure would have softened up the water cascades nicely which would have really added some depth to this one.  It''s worth doing over with the right tools or even trying several different exposures & combining them with Photoshop to get the perfect composition.', '2006-11-24 18:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060260, 428777, 67841, '<td valign="top">Can''t help but wish the eyes were in focus instead of the forehead.</td>', 'Can''t help but wish the eyes were in focus instead of the forehead.', '2006-11-24 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
