(3060298, 429393, 67841, '<td valign="top">Bracketing your exposure here would have given you more options in post - the sky is completely lost on the left side.  This one is a prime example for HDR techniques.  Nice framing, though -the railing really completes the image for me.</td>', 'Bracketing your exposure here would have given you more options in post - the sky is completely lost on the left side.  This one is a prime example for HDR techniques.  Nice framing, though -the railing really completes the image for me.', '2006-11-24 19:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
