(3060364, 428900, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hihi, it looks like they are talking together... Well captured and composed. Good colors and nice details of the flowers make the picture nicer.</td>', 'Hihi, it looks like they are talking together... Well captured and composed. Good colors and nice details of the flowers make the picture nicer.', '2006-11-24 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060371, 429024, 57886, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty. The fact that there are no people there and the shadow on the tree AND the great colors - make this picture outstanding IMHO... love it :o)</td>', 'Wow, pretty. The fact that there are no people there and the shadow on the tree AND the great colors - make this picture outstanding IMHO... love it :o)', '2006-11-24 20:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060376, 429112, 57886, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection in the water. I also like the colors of the fall/winter... But, the sky looks a little bright (over exposed) to me and you have lost some details in the light building also. You could probably have avoided that with a faster shutter speed or maybe a filter?? Good luck :o)</td>', 'I like the reflection in the water. I also like the colors of the fall/winter... But, the sky looks a little bright (over exposed) to me and you have lost some details in the light building also. You could probably have avoided that with a faster shutter speed or maybe a filter?? Good luck :o)', '2006-11-24 20:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060378, 429253, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard. The picture is very good, nice colors, details and compostition. The New Mexico text looks good on it because it gives a kind of Mexican feeling to the picture which does not IMHO look very Mexican. Well done and good luck :o)</td>', 'Nice postcard. The picture is very good, nice colors, details and compostition. The New Mexico text looks good on it because it gives a kind of Mexican feeling to the picture which does not IMHO look very Mexican. Well done and good luck :o)', '2006-11-24 20:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060381, 428115, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hm... The depth in this picture is outstanding.. Gives the feeling of near and far. Colors are good.. Well made postcard. The only np from me are the dark areas around the trees and top of the "hill"..  But other from that, excellent :o)</td>', 'Hm... The depth in this picture is outstanding.. Gives the feeling of near and far. Colors are good.. Well made postcard. The only np from me are the dark areas around the trees and top of the "hill"..  But other from that, excellent :o)', '2006-11-24 20:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060391, 428960, 16046, '<td valign="top">wickedly cool, well done</td>', 'wickedly cool, well done', '2006-11-24 20:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060394, 429434, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice POV from Kerry Park, rare day indeed.</td>', 'Nice POV from Kerry Park, rare day indeed.', '2006-11-24 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060396, 429313, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice lights</td>', 'Nice lights', '2006-11-24 21:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060397, 429262, 16046, '<td valign="top">Should sell a lot of these, well done</td>', 'Should sell a lot of these, well done', '2006-11-24 21:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060412, 429091, 57400, '<td valign="top">Disgusting and totally immature!</td>', 'Disgusting and totally immature!', '2006-11-24 21:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060434, 428492, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my four 10''s ..... couldn''t ask for more in a postcard.</td>', 'One of my four 10''s ..... couldn''t ask for more in a postcard.', '2006-11-24 21:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060436, 429326, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my four 10''s in this challenge. Wonderful colors, composition and lovely choice of font/text.</td>', 'One of my four 10''s in this challenge. Wonderful colors, composition and lovely choice of font/text.', '2006-11-24 21:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060438, 429426, 66223, '<td valign="top">Great picture, I really like the textures.  I think it would work better with a "snootier" font, though...</td>', 'Great picture, I really like the textures.  I think it would work better with a "snootier" font, though...', '2006-11-24 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060442, 429253, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my four 10''s in this challenge. I love the natural looking colors, the fact that you didn''t oversaturate this. Not 100% pleased with the conflicting fonts (but I do like each one), but the photo is lovely.</td>', 'One of my four 10''s in this challenge. I love the natural looking colors, the fact that you didn''t oversaturate this. Not 100% pleased with the conflicting fonts (but I do like each one), but the photo is lovely.', '2006-11-24 21:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060444, 429277, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my four 10''s in this challenge. I have seen SO many photos of the opera house over the years, yet this one made me look twice. Great timing resulting in stunning light and colors.</td>', 'One of my four 10''s in this challenge. I have seen SO many photos of the opera house over the years, yet this one made me look twice. Great timing resulting in stunning light and colors.', '2006-11-24 21:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060447, 429294, 6519, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking shot</td>', 'Breathtaking shot', '2006-11-24 21:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060448, 429046, 6519, '<td valign="top">That was so worthwhile waiting for the right light!!</td>', 'That was so worthwhile waiting for the right light!!', '2006-11-24 21:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060449, 429308, 6519, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo - perfect lens for it, and very well exposed.</td>', 'Stunning photo - perfect lens for it, and very well exposed.', '2006-11-24 21:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060481, 428950, 24528, '<td valign="top">Rapid look powerful..</td>', 'Rapid look powerful..', '2006-11-24 22:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060484, 427805, 69003, '<td valign="top">Very nice, really makes good use of the tree for framing. Just a bit fuzzy or it would be an exceptional photo</td>', 'Very nice, really makes good use of the tree for framing. Just a bit fuzzy or it would be an exceptional photo', '2006-11-24 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060505, 428303, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color in sky.  There''s a lot of grain in the sky, consider using a tripod, lower ISO, and noise reduction software.  Also consider dodge and burn, etc., with advanced editing.</td>', 'Nice composition and color in sky.  There''s a lot of grain in the sky, consider using a tripod, lower ISO, and noise reduction software.  Also consider dodge and burn, etc., with advanced editing.', '2006-11-24 22:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060506, 429448, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, lights.  Overall image seems just too low key, with distracting bits in foreground.  Would be better cropped for the upper part, at least 3:2.  I can guess that the brightly lit event on the left made it difficult, consider cropping it out and re-editing for downtown.</td>', 'Nice subject, lights.  Overall image seems just too low key, with distracting bits in foreground.  Would be better cropped for the upper part, at least 3:2.  I can guess that the brightly lit event on the left made it difficult, consider cropping it out and re-editing for downtown.', '2006-11-24 22:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060507, 429224, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice snowy scene, color choices.  Unfortunately, the stump in the foreground is front and center, wish it were elsewhere.</td>', 'Nice snowy scene, color choices.  Unfortunately, the stump in the foreground is front and center, wish it were elsewhere.', '2006-11-24 22:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060508, 428744, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice ribbon and shadows.  I think at least a simple bow with some of the curls would help, but that an additional element like a bootie would be better.</td>', 'Nice ribbon and shadows.  I think at least a simple bow with some of the curls would help, but that an additional element like a bootie would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060510, 429226, 44490, '<td valign="top">The Opera House is certainly one of the most photogenic examples of architecture in the world.  Your image feels gray, probably from an overcast day - consider more contrast and saturation to compensate.</td>', 'The Opera House is certainly one of the most photogenic examples of architecture in the world.  Your image feels gray, probably from an overcast day - consider more contrast and saturation to compensate.', '2006-11-24 22:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060511, 429365, 44490, '<td valign="top">The Marina Towers are quite interesting.  I think that a lower perspective might be more interesting, maybe from between the towers, with adjustments using advanced editing to square things up.</td>', 'The Marina Towers are quite interesting.  I think that a lower perspective might be more interesting, maybe from between the towers, with adjustments using advanced editing to square things up.', '2006-11-24 22:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060513, 427215, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice mountains and color.  Fewer/less distracting branches would be better.</td>', 'Nice mountains and color.  Fewer/less distracting branches would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060514, 429262, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, could have been used as a great perspective shot also....</td>', 'Beautiful picture, could have been used as a great perspective shot also....', '2006-11-24 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060515, 429297, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, color.  I think that the Kentucky title style is a minus, please consider a cleaner font/label.</td>', 'Nice clarity, color.  I think that the Kentucky title style is a minus, please consider a cleaner font/label.', '2006-11-24 22:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060516, 428841, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, carpet of leaves on the road.  I''d like to smell more detail, please give us a bigger image, make larger dimension 640 pixels.</td>', 'Nice colors, carpet of leaves on the road.  I''d like to smell more detail, please give us a bigger image, make larger dimension 640 pixels.', '2006-11-24 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060517, 429421, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the "" image title and hard-to-read font are irritating, please help us.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the "" image title and hard-to-read font are irritating, please help us.', '2006-11-24 22:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060520, 427991, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting porch.  Unfortunately, it is obscured a bit by the fence, large title, and branches on the left.  Moving your perspective forward, reducing the obstructions would help.</td>', 'Interesting porch.  Unfortunately, it is obscured a bit by the fence, large title, and branches on the left.  Moving your perspective forward, reducing the obstructions would help.', '2006-11-24 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060521, 429157, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice cottage.  Seems to suffer a bit from UW perspective - square up the verticals and crop, either in camera or with software, or back up a bit with a longer focal length and crop.</td>', 'Nice cottage.  Seems to suffer a bit from UW perspective - square up the verticals and crop, either in camera or with software, or back up a bit with a longer focal length and crop.', '2006-11-24 22:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060522, 429331, 66348, '<td valign="top">Georgia is a beautiful state, love how you portrayed that in your picture...</td>', 'Georgia is a beautiful state, love how you portrayed that in your picture...', '2006-11-24 22:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060523, 429319, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice cowgirl.  Too bad the eyes are so shadowed.  It would be better without the distracting pattern/border.</td>', 'Nice cowgirl.  Too bad the eyes are so shadowed.  It would be better without the distracting pattern/border.', '2006-11-24 22:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060524, 429256, 66348, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture of San Fran, well done...</td>', 'Awesome picture of San Fran, well done...', '2006-11-24 22:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060525, 429248, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good composition, great reflection and clouds in sky.  Consider a touch more saturation for more postcard look.</td>', 'Good composition, great reflection and clouds in sky.  Consider a touch more saturation for more postcard look.', '2006-11-24 22:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060526, 429070, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  With this angle of sunlight, I think a perspective from further left would give you more light and be better as I''m trying to make out detail in the shadowed long face of the Henry House.</td>', 'Nice subject.  With this angle of sunlight, I think a perspective from further left would give you more light and be better as I''m trying to make out detail in the shadowed long face of the Henry House.', '2006-11-24 22:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060527, 428144, 66348, '<td valign="top">Grew up right around the corner, great picture, and wonderful job of bringing out the colors...</td>', 'Grew up right around the corner, great picture, and wonderful job of bringing out the colors...', '2006-11-24 22:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060528, 429417, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice building and foliage, colors.  I think that the crop is too tight, and the top/bottom borders and titles are a miss - consider less crop and overlaid titles.</td>', 'Nice building and foliage, colors.  I think that the crop is too tight, and the top/bottom borders and titles are a miss - consider less crop and overlaid titles.', '2006-11-24 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060530, 429212, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, great shot....</td>', 'Beautiful colors, great shot....', '2006-11-24 22:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060531, 429393, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice skyline, water, sky, colors.  Cropping out vegetation/debris in foreground would be better.</td>', 'Nice skyline, water, sky, colors.  Cropping out vegetation/debris in foreground would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060533, 427210, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection.  The bridge seems a little too dominant, I think that a step or two to the left would give a better perspective.</td>', 'Lovely reflection.  The bridge seems a little too dominant, I think that a step or two to the left would give a better perspective.', '2006-11-24 22:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060535, 428775, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of extreme scenery.  Overall image feels gray, and I''m sure that the time of year doesn''t help.  Consider cranking up saturation/blues/contrast/shadows to compensate.  A drop shadow on the title would also help.</td>', 'Nice capture of extreme scenery.  Overall image feels gray, and I''m sure that the time of year doesn''t help.  Consider cranking up saturation/blues/contrast/shadows to compensate.  A drop shadow on the title would also help.', '2006-11-24 22:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060536, 429186, 66348, '<td valign="top">Stunning reflections off of the water....great picture...</td>', 'Stunning reflections off of the water....great picture...', '2006-11-24 22:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060537, 428866, 44490, '<td valign="top">Classis lights on Puget Sound.  Scaling back the title would be better.</td>', 'Classis lights on Puget Sound.  Scaling back the title would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060538, 427333, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Subtitle seems wordy and too distracting, at least strike "unimportant," or how about "Treasure each day by noticing the wonder of it all."</td>', 'Nice colors.  Subtitle seems wordy and too distracting, at least strike "unimportant," or how about "Treasure each day by noticing the wonder of it all."', '2006-11-24 22:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060540, 429433, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...</td>', 'Beautiful shot...', '2006-11-24 22:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060541, 429096, 44490, '<td valign="top">I love the houses tucked into the rock, so much so that I think that a better perspective would be to step back to reduce the apparent size of the boat.  As it is, the boat seems like the main subject, and it seems somewhat truncated and tubby.</td>', 'I love the houses tucked into the rock, so much so that I think that a better perspective would be to step back to reduce the apparent size of the boat.  As it is, the boat seems like the main subject, and it seems somewhat truncated and tubby.', '2006-11-24 22:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060542, 428113, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment.  I think that discrete overlaid titles would be better.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment.  I think that discrete overlaid titles would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:52:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3060546, 428564, 66348, '<td valign="top">This looks just like a Vegas postcard, great picture...</td>', 'This looks just like a Vegas postcard, great picture...', '2006-11-24 22:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060549, 429187, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  Foreground branches are a little too intrusive, a slightly tighter crop to reduce them would probably be better.  Also consider bumping up saturation and constrast.</td>', 'Nice landscape.  Foreground branches are a little too intrusive, a slightly tighter crop to reduce them would probably be better.  Also consider bumping up saturation and constrast.', '2006-11-24 22:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060550, 428009, 66348, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture, love how the LONDON colors are matching your picture, well done...</td>', 'Awesome picture, love how the LONDON colors are matching your picture, well done...', '2006-11-24 22:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060555, 429364, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, good editing.  The branches are unfortunate, maybe there is a better perspective from the lower right that would reduce them, and also reduce the driveway.</td>', 'Lovely colors, good editing.  The branches are unfortunate, maybe there is a better perspective from the lower right that would reduce them, and also reduce the driveway.', '2006-11-24 22:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060556, 428928, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  Cropping of the black at the top would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  Cropping of the black at the top would be better.', '2006-11-24 22:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060557, 428928, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Bonsai....Nice picture..</td>', 'Beautiful Bonsai....Nice picture..', '2006-11-24 22:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060559, 428106, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape with lit bridge, silhouette of trees, color of sky.  Would be better without the bush, grasses, and fallen tree in foreground.</td>', 'Nice landscape with lit bridge, silhouette of trees, color of sky.  Would be better without the bush, grasses, and fallen tree in foreground.', '2006-11-24 22:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060562, 427805, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice historic scene.  Less of the branches would be better, e.g., a perspective from a step or two closer.</td>', 'Nice historic scene.  Less of the branches would be better, e.g., a perspective from a step or two closer.', '2006-11-24 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060564, 429409, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The buildings and bridge feel a bit gray, consider bringing up the midtones.  As it is, a better title/ad-line would be "Circle New York with the Circle Line."</td>', 'Nice composition.  The buildings and bridge feel a bit gray, consider bringing up the midtones.  As it is, a better title/ad-line would be "Circle New York with the Circle Line."', '2006-11-24 22:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060565, 429091, 66348, '<td valign="top">Perfect theme for a postcard....LOVE IT....</td>', 'Perfect theme for a postcard....LOVE IT....', '2006-11-24 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060566, 428679, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors...</td>', 'Beautiful colors...', '2006-11-24 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060573, 428537, 66348, '<td valign="top">Hate the city, love the picture...Wow stunning image...Great colors in the fireworks...</td>', 'Hate the city, love the picture...Wow stunning image...Great colors in the fireworks...', '2006-11-24 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060576, 429311, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and clarity.  Please consider straightening up the verticals, especially with advanced editing.  I like the lines, the circle on the left, the arc above (complete would be better), and the bench crowned with the brilliant red bush.</td>', 'Nice colors and clarity.  Please consider straightening up the verticals, especially with advanced editing.  I like the lines, the circle on the left, the arc above (complete would be better), and the bench crowned with the brilliant red bush.', '2006-11-24 23:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060584, 428666, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2006-11-24 23:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060587, 428974, 66348, '<td valign="top">Fog adds a great feel to the picture, nice shot...</td>', 'Fog adds a great feel to the picture, nice shot...', '2006-11-24 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060588, 429094, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mountains, lights in clouds, refection.  Feels like a postcard, very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful mountains, lights in clouds, refection.  Feels like a postcard, very nice.', '2006-11-24 23:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060589, 429312, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely lake, sky, colors, lines, lit capitol dome.  Wish for a little more detail in the dome, did you try dodging it?  Also consider a somewhat tighter crop with less water.</td>', 'Lovely lake, sky, colors, lines, lit capitol dome.  Wish for a little more detail in the dome, did you try dodging it?  Also consider a somewhat tighter crop with less water.', '2006-11-24 23:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060591, 427685, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, subjects, sky, foreground/background balance filled with the expanse of the lawn, placement of title.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice composition, subjects, sky, foreground/background balance filled with the expanse of the lawn, placement of title.  Well done.', '2006-11-24 23:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060595, 428811, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks warm and inviting.  Consider a crop with a little less foreground, and therefore a little more beach.</td>', 'Looks warm and inviting.  Consider a crop with a little less foreground, and therefore a little more beach.', '2006-11-24 23:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060599, 428900, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose, made me sit up to examine that they''re real.  Good clarity and color.</td>', 'Wonderful pose, made me sit up to examine that they''re real.  Good clarity and color.', '2006-11-24 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060610, 429444, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great shot with the bird, beach, and sky.  I''d like it better with the titles scaled down, less distraction, and I''d be able to see more waves, etc.</td>', 'Great shot with the bird, beach, and sky.  I''d like it better with the titles scaled down, less distraction, and I''d be able to see more waves, etc.', '2006-11-24 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060614, 428961, 44490, '<td valign="top">Too cute, especially how the joey appears stuffed into the pouch with legs in a tangle, hanging out.</td>', 'Too cute, especially how the joey appears stuffed into the pouch with legs in a tangle, hanging out.', '2006-11-24 23:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060617, 429438, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the lights and waterfront, colors, especially given the poor shooting conditions during the week in the northeast.  I think that the fence is a little too dominant, that you should back up from it just a bit to lessen it''s proportions.</td>', 'Nice shot of the lights and waterfront, colors, especially given the poor shooting conditions during the week in the northeast.  I think that the fence is a little too dominant, that you should back up from it just a bit to lessen it''s proportions.', '2006-11-24 23:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060622, 429381, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow great colors in the sky, beautiful picture..</td>', 'Wow great colors in the sky, beautiful picture..', '2006-11-24 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060623, 429046, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lighting on main subject, water, rocks, light under bridge in background.  Wonderfully balanced and complete post card image.</td>', 'Nice composition, lighting on main subject, water, rocks, light under bridge in background.  Wonderfully balanced and complete post card image.', '2006-11-24 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060627, 429043, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice balanced shot with postcard feel, colors, reflection.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice balanced shot with postcard feel, colors, reflection.  Nicely done.', '2006-11-24 23:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060629, 428679, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and light highlights the B&amp;B nicely.  Picturesque, and meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Lovely colors and light highlights the B&B nicely.  Picturesque, and meets the challenge well.', '2006-11-24 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060630, 427774, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great postcard...Nice shot of my birth place... well done</td>', 'Great postcard...Nice shot of my birth place... well done', '2006-11-24 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060631, 428068, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, reminds me of representing AT&amp;T and our AAC jukebox on the upper level at the reopening of the RRHoF.  I like Cleveland.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, reminds me of representing AT&T and our AAC jukebox on the upper level at the reopening of the RRHoF.  I like Cleveland.', '2006-11-24 23:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060633, 429277, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the Opera House at sunset, nice light, moon, reflections, title.</td>', 'Nice shot of the Opera House at sunset, nice light, moon, reflections, title.', '2006-11-24 23:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060635, 429233, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great shot of spectacular architecture.  But the title and boarders overwhelm it - please scale the title back, at least.</td>', 'Great shot of spectacular architecture.  But the title and boarders overwhelm it - please scale the title back, at least.', '2006-11-24 23:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060637, 429291, 44490, '<td valign="top">Classic postcard, complete with ferry.  Consider bringing up midtones even more.  Love it.</td>', 'Classic postcard, complete with ferry.  Consider bringing up midtones even more.  Love it.', '2006-11-24 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060638, 428955, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, layers, depths, detail.  The right side is obscuring and overpowering, but I think that it could be remedied simply by cropping some of it out.</td>', 'Lovely colors, layers, depths, detail.  The right side is obscuring and overpowering, but I think that it could be remedied simply by cropping some of it out.', '2006-11-24 23:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060640, 428342, 66348, '<td valign="top">Ummm....nice colors??? Great body...and Great shot....</td>', 'Ummm....nice colors??? Great body...and Great shot....', '2006-11-24 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060641, 428889, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape catching the Space Needle, Seattle Center, Mt. Rainier, and color in sky.  I think that the big "Seattle" overlay kills the shot, a more discrete script title in the upper right corner would be better.</td>', 'Nice landscape catching the Space Needle, Seattle Center, Mt. Rainier, and color in sky.  I think that the big "Seattle" overlay kills the shot, a more discrete script title in the upper right corner would be better.', '2006-11-24 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060643, 429313, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic range and clarity, lovely lights reflected in the water.  Nice.</td>', 'Good dynamic range and clarity, lovely lights reflected in the water.  Nice.', '2006-11-24 23:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060645, 429126, 44490, '<td valign="top">Love the lines of the cliffs, waves on the beach, colors.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Love the lines of the cliffs, waves on the beach, colors.  Nice composition.', '2006-11-24 23:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060646, 429229, 44490, '<td valign="top">This should have been an entry for "Wind!"  For this challenge, a title in white in the upper right would make it feel more like a postcard.  Love the windmills.</td>', 'This should have been an entry for "Wind!"  For this challenge, a title in white in the upper right would make it feel more like a postcard.  Love the windmills.', '2006-11-24 23:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060647, 428743, 66348, '<td valign="top">Would love to visit, my father was born in the Azores, well done with this picture, it makes you really want visit...</td>', 'Would love to visit, my father was born in the Azores, well done with this picture, it makes you really want visit...', '2006-11-24 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060651, 429294, 44490, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sky with stars, road through the snowy mountains.  I think that you could have come up with a better title that''s not so obviously false, but the image is so good that there''s no penalty from me.  10 and hope that it does well.</td>', 'Fantastic sky with stars, road through the snowy mountains.  I think that you could have come up with a better title that''s not so obviously false, but the image is so good that there''s no penalty from me.  10 and hope that it does well.', '2006-11-24 23:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060652, 428666, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely location and capture, very fitting to the challenge, beautiful moment, lights, love it.</td>', 'Lovely location and capture, very fitting to the challenge, beautiful moment, lights, love it.', '2006-11-24 23:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060653, 428537, 44490, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice timing and addition to beautiful lights and refections of downtown Pittsburgh.</td>', 'Great shot, nice timing and addition to beautiful lights and refections of downtown Pittsburgh.', '2006-11-24 23:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
