(3060713, 429208, 64928, '<td valign="top">Nice collection and a good job of photographing it. You did a great job on the compostion. I can see this as a postcard.</td>', 'Nice collection and a good job of photographing it. You did a great job on the compostion. I can see this as a postcard.', '2006-11-25 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
