(3060725, 428398, 64928, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m really having trouble imagining this as a postcard.  Aside from that, my eyes all over the place in this photo.  It just doesn''t have a flow to it. I like the way the word "London" is in the background with the angel in front of it.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m really having trouble imagining this as a postcard.  Aside from that, my eyes all over the place in this photo.  It just doesn''t have a flow to it. I like the way the word "London" is in the background with the angel in front of it.', '2006-11-25 00:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060728, 428777, 64928, '<td valign="top">I like the way the trunk seems to come in front of the frame, but the elephant has an overprocessed look, which lowers the score for me.</td>', 'I like the way the trunk seems to come in front of the frame, but the elephant has an overprocessed look, which lowers the score for me.', '2006-11-25 00:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
