(3060806, 429039, 64928, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors, but your highlights are a bit blown, and focus could be a little clearer.  It looks like some selections problems in the post processing in the sky area where you tried to add some of the blue back to the sky.  I hope you get advice on how to overcome this as I often have the same problem.</td>', 'I like the bright colors, but your highlights are a bit blown, and focus could be a little clearer.  It looks like some selections problems in the post processing in the sky area where you tried to add some of the blue back to the sky.  I hope you get advice on how to overcome this as I often have the same problem.', '2006-11-25 01:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3060814, 429091, 64928, '<td valign="top">I don''t like shoes on the beach, either, but more than that I don''t care for the suggestion of fowl language across an otherwise pretty good picture.</td>', 'I don''t like shoes on the beach, either, but more than that I don''t care for the suggestion of fowl language across an otherwise pretty good picture.', '2006-11-25 01:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
