(3060861, 429416, 64928, '<td valign="top">This would make a great postcard!  It would also have been a great photo for the perspective challenge.  Though this statue is at least a block away from the capitol building, and of course, not nearly so tall, it looks like the cowboy is holding the hat over the building. I like the lighting on the hat and that you managed to have the statue and the building all so clearly in focus.  Great shot! 10</td>', 'This would make a great postcard!  It would also have been a great photo for the perspective challenge.  Though this statue is at least a block away from the capitol building, and of course, not nearly so tall, it looks like the cowboy is holding the hat over the building. I like the lighting on the hat and that you managed to have the statue and the building all so clearly in focus.  Great shot! 10', '2006-11-25 01:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
