(3060997, 429059, 31133, '<td valign="top">For my taste, this is a bit too grainy. Also, although I love the composition - it''s very nice with the negative space - I have to say I''m not crazy about the frame. The text is difficult for me to read. Again, I do like the compostion, so nice job on that! The dome is quite interesting.</td>', 'For my taste, this is a bit too grainy. Also, although I love the composition - it''s very nice with the negative space - I have to say I''m not crazy about the frame. The text is difficult for me to read. Again, I do like the compostion, so nice job on that! The dome is quite interesting.', '2006-11-25 06:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061000, 429084, 31133, '<td valign="top">Yay for little Rhodey! The colors and depth are both amazing here. Really, really like this. Also, I appreciate the care that went into the text - it looks like a real postcard. Those reflections are beautiful! I''d like to guess - Worden''s pond?</td>', 'Yay for little Rhodey! The colors and depth are both amazing here. Really, really like this. Also, I appreciate the care that went into the text - it looks like a real postcard. Those reflections are beautiful! I''d like to guess - Worden''s pond?', '2006-11-25 06:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061003, 429202, 31133, '<td valign="top">The halo around the castle really disturbs me. I''m sorry. It does look like an amazing place though - I''d love to visit someday.</td>', 'The halo around the castle really disturbs me. I''m sorry. It does look like an amazing place though - I''d love to visit someday.', '2006-11-25 06:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061007, 429337, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hahah, very cute title! I really have a weakness for fog shots and this one is no exception. The font on the image is not my favorite though. I like the lonely boat with only the small buoy for company, and also all that negative space. Giving this one a 7.</td>', 'Hahah, very cute title! I really have a weakness for fog shots and this one is no exception. The font on the image is not my favorite though. I like the lonely boat with only the small buoy for company, and also all that negative space. Giving this one a 7.', '2006-11-25 06:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061010, 429294, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow!! The green and the light are stunning, as is everything else, such as leading lines, composition, clarity! I wish I were half this good. Way to go, whoever you are.</td>', 'Wow!! The green and the light are stunning, as is everything else, such as leading lines, composition, clarity! I wish I were half this good. Way to go, whoever you are.', '2006-11-25 06:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061018, 429091, 38509, '<td valign="top">bold.</td>', 'bold.', '2006-11-25 06:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061019, 429084, 38509, '<td valign="top">wow, excellent 9</td>', 'wow, excellent 9', '2006-11-25 06:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061020, 429439, 38509, '<td valign="top">great, nice composition and colors</td>', 'great, nice composition and colors', '2006-11-25 06:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061022, 428778, 31133, '<td valign="top">GREAT! I''m guessing this is one of Judy''s cows. They''re adorable - sooo bored by the photographer. Check out the look they''re giving you :) I really like the crop and the toning. I might like the text to be a bit more predominate, but appreciate the way it doesn''t overwhelm the image as it is. This is one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'GREAT! I''m guessing this is one of Judy''s cows. They''re adorable - sooo bored by the photographer. Check out the look they''re giving you :) I really like the crop and the toning. I might like the text to be a bit more predominate, but appreciate the way it doesn''t overwhelm the image as it is. This is one of my favorites so far.', '2006-11-25 06:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061024, 429094, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a perfect postcard! The text is very tasteful. The image is nothing short of stunning. Must have been a completely windless day to get that amazing reflection. Very nice job.</td>', 'What a perfect postcard! The text is very tasteful. The image is nothing short of stunning. Must have been a completely windless day to get that amazing reflection. Very nice job.', '2006-11-25 06:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061028, 429140, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the yellow is going to hurt you a bit here. Possibly the same setup with border and text would work better with white. Also it appears that the image, at least the sign with all its small signs in the vicinity, is over sharpened. I think the shot meets the challenge quite well, but might get an even better reaction if it were not so centered. This would give it a more dynamic feeling. This is all just my opinion - lord knows, I''m no expert. Hope you don''t mind all this input on your image. I think Paradise, Ca looks like a lovely place to visit.</td>', 'I think the yellow is going to hurt you a bit here. Possibly the same setup with border and text would work better with white. Also it appears that the image, at least the sign with all its small signs in the vicinity, is over sharpened. I think the shot meets the challenge quite well, but might get an even better reaction if it were not so centered. This would give it a more dynamic feeling. This is all just my opinion - lord knows, I''m no expert. Hope you don''t mind all this input on your image. I think Paradise, Ca looks like a lovely place to visit.', '2006-11-25 06:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061031, 429039, 31133, '<td valign="top">Basingstoke?! I''m going there for work next week - had no idea there were such pretty places to see there. This is therefore a postcard in the best sense. You''ve shown me something positive about a place in the world that I didn''t think had so much to offer other than industry. The colors and the line leading to the canal are very nice. I am a bit distracted by the blown part of the boat to left, but not overly so. I also wish the sidewalk/grass on the right were either lighter or darker to add dynamic feeling, but in basic that would probably be impossible to do without making the rest of the image suffer. The leaves in the water are perfect, just perfect. Nice job!</td>', 'Basingstoke?! I''m going there for work next week - had no idea there were such pretty places to see there. This is therefore a postcard in the best sense. You''ve shown me something positive about a place in the world that I didn''t think had so much to offer other than industry. The colors and the line leading to the canal are very nice. I am a bit distracted by the blown part of the boat to left, but not overly so. I also wish the sidewalk/grass on the right were either lighter or darker to add dynamic feeling, but in basic that would probably be impossible to do without making the rest of the image suffer. The leaves in the water are perfect, just perfect. Nice job!', '2006-11-25 06:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061032, 429303, 31133, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous clarity and fall colors. The composition is classic, with the leading lines and rule of thirds. I like all the lines from the bench, fence, waterfall, each making their own geometry. The only niggle with this for me is the skyline where it meets the trees. Otherwise, very, very nice!</td>', 'Gorgeous clarity and fall colors. The composition is classic, with the leading lines and rule of thirds. I like all the lines from the bench, fence, waterfall, each making their own geometry. The only niggle with this for me is the skyline where it meets the trees. Otherwise, very, very nice!', '2006-11-25 06:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061036, 429340, 31133, '<td valign="top">The text overwhelms the delicate lights and reflections on the water. I''d like to see less grain, too. The positives for me are the colors (love the reds!) and the way the river curves off towards the right. I find the blown parts of the lights to be a bit overwhelming, and wonder how it might be if the entire image were a bit darker. I do like the way the shore frames the bottom of the image.</td>', 'The text overwhelms the delicate lights and reflections on the water. I''d like to see less grain, too. The positives for me are the colors (love the reds!) and the way the river curves off towards the right. I find the blown parts of the lights to be a bit overwhelming, and wonder how it might be if the entire image were a bit darker. I do like the way the shore frames the bottom of the image.', '2006-11-25 06:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061039, 429421, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m having a very hard time reading the text on the right and actually have no idea what it says. If I ignore that, I love the birds and sky! There''s one bird bottom left that looks almost like an airplane in the background. The texture in the sky is really wonderful.</td>', 'I''m having a very hard time reading the text on the right and actually have no idea what it says. If I ignore that, I love the birds and sky! There''s one bird bottom left that looks almost like an airplane in the background. The texture in the sky is really wonderful.', '2006-11-25 06:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061040, 429326, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is beautiful in every way. There doesn''t seem to be a single aspect out of place. I hope you put this in your portfolio later without the text. If I see it then, I will add it to my favorites. Lovely shot!</td>', 'Wow. This is beautiful in every way. There doesn''t seem to be a single aspect out of place. I hope you put this in your portfolio later without the text. If I see it then, I will add it to my favorites. Lovely shot!', '2006-11-25 06:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061043, 429376, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot with the gorgeous pastel colors and the lone surfer. The text is a drawback for me though, because the gradient in the text contradicts or conflicts with the calm feeling given by your photograph.</td>', 'I like this a lot with the gorgeous pastel colors and the lone surfer. The text is a drawback for me though, because the gradient in the text contradicts or conflicts with the calm feeling given by your photograph.', '2006-11-25 06:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061045, 429104, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great postcard. I''m crazy about the angle of view - really unique and very nice. Another thing I appreciate about this is the subtle text. It''s perfect for a postcard and gives a little info about Stavanger, too.</td>', 'Great postcard. I''m crazy about the angle of view - really unique and very nice. Another thing I appreciate about this is the subtle text. It''s perfect for a postcard and gives a little info about Stavanger, too.', '2006-11-25 06:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061047, 427663, 31133, '<td valign="top">The buildings seem a bit too blurry to me. I think the sky is lovely though - beautiful colors!</td>', 'The buildings seem a bit too blurry to me. I think the sky is lovely though - beautiful colors!', '2006-11-25 07:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061051, 427767, 31133, '<td valign="top">I would make the suggestion to make the green text on the left be the title and remove it from the image. I think the text on the right is good. As for the image, it''s GREAT, but overpowered unfortunately by all the text. Nice wide-angle shot.</td>', 'I would make the suggestion to make the green text on the left be the title and remove it from the image. I think the text on the right is good. As for the image, it''s GREAT, but overpowered unfortunately by all the text. Nice wide-angle shot.', '2006-11-25 07:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061066, 429417, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this is a lovely image, but the white at the top detracts (for my taste). It''s cutting off the tops of the gables and since it''s not the same shade of white, it adds some distraction. The text is beautiful as in the general composition, but I would love to see the entire building.</td>', 'I think this is a lovely image, but the white at the top detracts (for my taste). It''s cutting off the tops of the gables and since it''s not the same shade of white, it adds some distraction. The text is beautiful as in the general composition, but I would love to see the entire building.', '2006-11-25 07:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061110, 429233, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great sky for this!  Very nicely composed and the lettering works well with the image.</td>', 'Great sky for this!  Very nicely composed and the lettering works well with the image.', '2006-11-25 08:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
