(3061256, 428802, 31133, '<td valign="top">I used to live right next to this!! I love the shot, but most of all, you can imagine how surprised I am to be sitting here in Sweden voting and see Pt. Judith lighthouse. Cool! Technically, this seems nearly perfect. There is a wonderful painterly quality going on -love the light on the door at the base of the lighthouse. Very nice job. Thanks for taking care with the text, too. It looks good.</td>', 'I used to live right next to this!! I love the shot, but most of all, you can imagine how surprised I am to be sitting here in Sweden voting and see Pt. Judith lighthouse. Cool! Technically, this seems nearly perfect. There is a wonderful painterly quality going on -love the light on the door at the base of the lighthouse. Very nice job. Thanks for taking care with the text, too. It looks good.', '2006-11-25 11:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
