(3061588, 429150, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Wonderful framing and text, too. I really like the figures at the base of the image. Beautiful sunset, beautiful shot!</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Wonderful framing and text, too. I really like the figures at the base of the image. Beautiful sunset, beautiful shot!', '2006-11-25 15:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061589, 428068, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a great reflection! I''m not voting differently because of this, but I wish the text was sized so none of the museum''s reflection were covered.</td>', 'What a great reflection! I''m not voting differently because of this, but I wish the text was sized so none of the museum''s reflection were covered.', '2006-11-25 15:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061590, 429433, 31133, '<td valign="top">Adorable little squirrel! These guys are tough to capture at their usual lightening speed - nice job getting this one. Great bokeh, too.</td>', 'Adorable little squirrel! These guys are tough to capture at their usual lightening speed - nice job getting this one. Great bokeh, too.', '2006-11-25 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061596, 428676, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and interesting subject, I think cutting the left side of the chair out may hurt the score but still a very nice image.</td>', 'Great lighting and interesting subject, I think cutting the left side of the chair out may hurt the score but still a very nice image.', '2006-11-25 15:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061603, 429015, 60495, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, maybe just a little to tight on the crop and to me the lettering interfers with the image, looking at the image I am not sure where I would have put lettering but you might be able to add a border and put the lettering on the outside edge so it does not cover the horse or some other interesting part of the photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject, maybe just a little to tight on the crop and to me the lettering interfers with the image, looking at the image I am not sure where I would have put lettering but you might be able to add a border and put the lettering on the outside edge so it does not cover the horse or some other interesting part of the photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-25 16:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061606, 429448, 67258, '<td valign="top">Whilst the concept of an arial photo of the city at night is good, and you have found a potentially good vantage point, I don''t feel you have really pulled it off.  The focus on the city itself seems too soft, and the inclusion of the railings is distracting.</td>', 'Whilst the concept of an arial photo of the city at night is good, and you have found a potentially good vantage point, I don''t feel you have really pulled it off.  The focus on the city itself seems too soft, and the inclusion of the railings is distracting.', '2006-11-25 16:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061610, 429059, 67258, '<td valign="top">Umm not one of the more interesting Yorkshire scenes...  I don''t feel this really works as a postcard - too much ''negative space'' and the font style,size and positioning doesn''t do much to enhance it.</td>', 'Umm not one of the more interesting Yorkshire scenes...  I don''t feel this really works as a postcard - too much ''negative space'' and the font style,size and positioning doesn''t do much to enhance it.', '2006-11-25 16:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061611, 429015, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the writing in red - it makes the card seem cluttered, and I find it quite hard to read.</td>', 'I don''t care for the writing in red - it makes the card seem cluttered, and I find it quite hard to read.', '2006-11-25 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061612, 429202, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft and there isn''t much detail in the rather dark castle.  There seems to be a it of a bright halo around the castle - although that may be my monitor, perhaps.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft and there isn''t much detail in the rather dark castle.  There seems to be a it of a bright halo around the castle - although that may be my monitor, perhaps.', '2006-11-25 16:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061615, 428617, 67258, '<td valign="top">Rather a lot of empty foreground and perhaps to many scattered sheep to be truly aesthetically (sp?)pleasing.</td>', 'Rather a lot of empty foreground and perhaps to many scattered sheep to be truly aesthetically (sp?)pleasing.', '2006-11-25 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061616, 427053, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of re-creating an old vintage style postcard, but don''t feel you have quite pulled it off.  There are definite exposure issues, with burnt out areas in some of the clouds and the whites of at least one of the buildings, and some areas in darkness.</td>', 'I like the idea of re-creating an old vintage style postcard, but don''t feel you have quite pulled it off.  There are definite exposure issues, with burnt out areas in some of the clouds and the whites of at least one of the buildings, and some areas in darkness.', '2006-11-25 16:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061650, 429294, 53243, '<td valign="top">Wow - the stars and the aurora lights are beautiful.  This is not fair!</td>', 'Wow - the stars and the aurora lights are beautiful.  This is not fair!', '2006-11-25 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3061651, 427657, 53243, '<td valign="top">How beautiful - very touching!</td>', 'How beautiful - very touching!', '2006-11-25 16:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
