(3062471, 429253, 23300, '<td valign="top">Yep...Less is more. A beautiful image. My only suggestion is that the text at the bottom is distracting and I think it would have done its job just as well by being in small typeface just under the main heading...Anyway I''m sure you don''t really want a desktop publishing critique  :) As I said a beautiful and surprisingly evocative image.</td>', 'Yep...Less is more. A beautiful image. My only suggestion is that the text at the bottom is distracting and I think it would have done its job just as well by being in small typeface just under the main heading...Anyway I''m sure you don''t really want a desktop publishing critique  :) As I said a beautiful and surprisingly evocative image.', '2006-11-26 01:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062473, 427215, 25355, '<td valign="top">I guess a lot of people would assume this is mine because of the numerous photos I''ve taken in the Nikko area, me being a sort of local. ;&gt;þ</td>', 'I guess a lot of people would assume this is mine because of the numerous photos I''ve taken in the Nikko area, me being a sort of local. ;>þ', '2006-11-26 02:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
