(3062531, 429063, 35545, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the foreground is too dark.  I know that''s probably what it looks like, but this might have been a good opportunity to use tone mapping to bring out more details.</td>', 'The shadow in the foreground is too dark.  I know that''s probably what it looks like, but this might have been a good opportunity to use tone mapping to bring out more details.', '2006-11-26 03:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
