(3062568, 428374, 31133, '<td valign="top">Oh, I think this is really nice. The dof is especially fine. Good job with the composition, too. I like the subtle text.</td>', 'Oh, I think this is really nice. The dof is especially fine. Good job with the composition, too. I like the subtle text.', '2006-11-26 04:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062570, 429116, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''d lie to see this cropped so there were either more of the branch at the right or none of it. What I like is the reflection and the slightly off-center composition of the main entrance. Is it tilted slightly counter-clockwise? Another niggle I have is the blown out lights. I wonder how the image would be if it were darkened a bit? No idea, I''m just guessing that might the reflections stand out even more.</td>', 'I''d lie to see this cropped so there were either more of the branch at the right or none of it. What I like is the reflection and the slightly off-center composition of the main entrance. Is it tilted slightly counter-clockwise? Another niggle I have is the blown out lights. I wonder how the image would be if it were darkened a bit? No idea, I''m just guessing that might the reflections stand out even more.', '2006-11-26 04:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062571, 428775, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, for some reason this reminds me of my Perspective entry and I have the same comment on yours as what I''m getting there: this could use a tad more saturation to make it more dynamic and add to the drama. Yours is a much better image than mine, so please take my comments with a grain of salt. I like the drama of the turbulent water and as I inspect this image more closely, I see that there''s quite a bit of interest in the sky too! So this would be a perfect candidate for higher saturation and maybe some curves to bring out contrast. Looks like a wonderful place!</td>', 'Ah, for some reason this reminds me of my Perspective entry and I have the same comment on yours as what I''m getting there: this could use a tad more saturation to make it more dynamic and add to the drama. Yours is a much better image than mine, so please take my comments with a grain of salt. I like the drama of the turbulent water and as I inspect this image more closely, I see that there''s quite a bit of interest in the sky too! So this would be a perfect candidate for higher saturation and maybe some curves to bring out contrast. Looks like a wonderful place!', '2006-11-26 04:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062572, 429222, 31133, '<td valign="top">What an adorable seal! I like the image a lot, but suspect attention would be drawn to it even more if the frame and text were either black or white. The color conflicts with the image itself in my opinion. Good clarity on the water an bubbles. I like the way the seal is swimming out of the image to right.</td>', 'What an adorable seal! I like the image a lot, but suspect attention would be drawn to it even more if the frame and text were either black or white. The color conflicts with the image itself in my opinion. Good clarity on the water an bubbles. I like the way the seal is swimming out of the image to right.', '2006-11-26 04:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062573, 428397, 31133, '<td valign="top">Oh, what wonderful toning! This is one of the most original compositions I''ve seen. I like it very much and have no criticism at all, no matter how hard I look. Great job!</td>', 'Oh, what wonderful toning! This is one of the most original compositions I''ve seen. I like it very much and have no criticism at all, no matter how hard I look. Great job!', '2006-11-26 04:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062574, 429330, 31133, '<td valign="top">The composition is lovely here. I like that it is centered, contrary to the normal rule of thirds. I also think the lighting is perfect and there''s very good color. But I do have some critique as well: This image could''ve really benefited from noise reduction, as there is quite a bit of visible grain, especially in the sky. Also, it looks like the image is tilted clockwise a few degrees. If the noise were reduced and the image were straight with the horizon, I think your overall challenge score would''ve been quite a bit higher. But I like the image a lot, as described above. Well done!</td>', 'The composition is lovely here. I like that it is centered, contrary to the normal rule of thirds. I also think the lighting is perfect and there''s very good color. But I do have some critique as well: This image could''ve really benefited from noise reduction, as there is quite a bit of visible grain, especially in the sky. Also, it looks like the image is tilted clockwise a few degrees. If the noise were reduced and the image were straight with the horizon, I think your overall challenge score would''ve been quite a bit higher. But I like the image a lot, as described above. Well done!', '2006-11-26 04:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062575, 428519, 31133, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, but looks a bit oversharpened, particularly in the feathers. Might be nice to see a tighter crop at the bottom (with smaller text) because the brown rock or wood is tough to identify. Cool looking bird!!!</td>', 'Great clarity, but looks a bit oversharpened, particularly in the feathers. Might be nice to see a tighter crop at the bottom (with smaller text) because the brown rock or wood is tough to identify. Cool looking bird!!!', '2006-11-26 04:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
