(3062634, 429096, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice "fishing village" feel.  I can see this postcard in a drug store in the town in the distance.  Great work! 10</td>', 'Very nice "fishing village" feel.  I can see this postcard in a drug store in the town in the distance.  Great work! 10', '2006-11-26 05:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
