(3062715, 428144, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but you lost it with the lens shade shadows in the corners</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but you lost it with the lens shade shadows in the corners', '2006-11-26 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062823, 429256, 22689, '<td valign="top">Don''t like much the font of the letters but the photo is fantastic , one of the best imho in this challenge.my vote 9</td>', 'Don''t like much the font of the letters but the photo is fantastic , one of the best imho in this challenge.my vote 9', '2006-11-26 11:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062852, 429150, 35044, '<td valign="top">Back in my film days I took a load of pics of this subject, then realised when the sun had set that I had used a black &amp; white film...<br/> <br/>Nice image.  Square/Portrait doesn''t shout postcard, but I like the text.  Image is a nice silhouette, but I think that at least part of it needs to be a bit brighter: you could add this in using photoshop, or achieve it using graded filters at the time of the exposure.</td>', 'Back in my film days I took a load of pics of this subject, then realised when the sun had set that I had used a black & white film... Nice image.  Square/Portrait doesn''t shout postcard, but I like the text.  Image is a nice silhouette, but I think that at least part of it needs to be a bit brighter: you could add this in using photoshop, or achieve it using graded filters at the time of the exposure.', '2006-11-26 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062865, 429045, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo - makes for a lovely postcard. 9<br/>Edit  Just been through all the postcards for a final review, and bumped up to 10.Am I right in thinking that there is very subtle use of HDR here? The exposure is absoltely spot on, either way.  Lovely work.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo - makes for a lovely postcard. 9Edit  Just been through all the postcards for a final review, and bumped up to 10.Am I right in thinking that there is very subtle use of HDR here? The exposure is absoltely spot on, either way.  Lovely work.', '2006-11-26 11:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3062882, 429265, 48115, '<td valign="top">I woulde never buy this as a postcard im so sorry. uniteressting, and dose not show me a side of new york that is injoyable. there for im giving you a 2</td>', 'I woulde never buy this as a postcard im so sorry. uniteressting, and dose not show me a side of new york that is injoyable. there for im giving you a 2', '2006-11-26 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
