(3064210, 429007, 60862, '<td valign="top">A few problems here, although the view is nice.  The greens seem way too saturated.  The horizon is tilted, but not enough to show you meant to do that.  And the horizon''s pretty close to the middle, which makes it less interesting.  Finally, my eye yearns for more contrast.  I bet you could get those clouds looking pretty dramatic.</td>', 'A few problems here, although the view is nice.  The greens seem way too saturated.  The horizon is tilted, but not enough to show you meant to do that.  And the horizon''s pretty close to the middle, which makes it less interesting.  Finally, my eye yearns for more contrast.  I bet you could get those clouds looking pretty dramatic.', '2006-11-26 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
