(3065166, 428009, 19474, '<td valign="top">Alex this is a great shot and it had me worried all week as my score was following yours in dropping all week long<br/>I love the coloring of this and will have to try this type of toning on some of the sights of Sydney (but not the opera house as I need to shot something else)</td>', 'Alex this is a great shot and it had me worried all week as my score was following yours in dropping all week longI love the coloring of this and will have to try this type of toning on some of the sights of Sydney (but not the opera house as I need to shot something else)', '2006-11-27 06:53:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065176, 429070, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Thought it made a nice postcard.  Text was nice and clean and the framing/crop well suited.  Perhaps a little dark, but your design, font choice, etc made up for it, in my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Thought it made a nice postcard.  Text was nice and clean and the framing/crop well suited.  Perhaps a little dark, but your design, font choice, etc made up for it, in my opinion.', '2006-11-27 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
