(3065195, 428765, 31829, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.  Like a tard, I had the year set to 2005... Dooh!<br/> <br/>Anyway, to answer the question of where I photographed this from.  It was photographed from the Iwa Jima memorial which is located just across the Potomac from the Lincoln memorial.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone.  Like a tard, I had the year set to 2005... Dooh! Anyway, to answer the question of where I photographed this from.  It was photographed from the Iwa Jima memorial which is located just across the Potomac from the Lincoln memorial.', '2006-11-27 07:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
