(3065219, 427818, 32754, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that this was a most unusual shot with a tower in the foreground prevented it from scoring higher with many people; but it was a striking and creative image...one of my top picks, it gives one the feeling of looking into a bustling modern harbour late in the night juxtaposed against the medieval tower of an older city..well done.</td>', 'I think the fact that this was a most unusual shot with a tower in the foreground prevented it from scoring higher with many people; but it was a striking and creative image...one of my top picks, it gives one the feeling of looking into a bustling modern harbour late in the night juxtaposed against the medieval tower of an older city..well done.', '2006-11-27 07:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
