(3065455, 429190, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is very good, your challenge photos have improved dramatically.<br/>quality wise :)<br/>cute postcard</td>', 'this is very good, your challenge photos have improved dramatically.quality wise :)cute postcard', '2006-11-27 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065458, 429310, 57229, '<td valign="top">Tungsten is metal used in filaments for incandescent light bulbs. Presumably they give a yellow sort of light so that the camera invokes a blue cast to compensate for it. If the word comes from Swedish, then it means ''heavy stone'' - who knew? As you see it is has magical properties that enable people to score over six. Congrats, and it''s a great shot. Where would all this have been without Batman?</td>', 'Tungsten is metal used in filaments for incandescent light bulbs. Presumably they give a yellow sort of light so that the camera invokes a blue cast to compensate for it. If the word comes from Swedish, then it means ''heavy stone'' - who knew? As you see it is has magical properties that enable people to score over six. Congrats, and it''s a great shot. Where would all this have been without Batman?', '2006-11-27 10:00:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065465, 429337, 57229, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of making the text part of the composition. And the title expands further. You got success.</td>', 'Excellent job of making the text part of the composition. And the title expands further. You got success.', '2006-11-27 10:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
