(3065487, 429190, 14386, '<td valign="top">This, actually is my pick for the blue.  Creative cropping!</td>', 'This, actually is my pick for the blue.  Creative cropping!', '2006-11-27 10:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065488, 428857, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a wonderful photo and great finish. Love the shot - gave it a 10. I don''t think there is a lack of color. I think there is a beautiful soft, warm, subtle color.</td>', 'Congratulations on a wonderful photo and great finish. Love the shot - gave it a 10. I don''t think there is a lack of color. I think there is a beautiful soft, warm, subtle color.', '2006-11-27 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065501, 429176, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the angle a lot, but since it''s not centered, the centered text makes it look ... disjointed?  Centered often isn''t as interesting, but it would work well for this symmetrical view, so try to make it really centered.<br/> <br/>Also, try a more interesting font.<br/> <br/>I missed this in voting, but would''ve given it a 6.  With the changes above, maybe higher. :)</td>', 'I like the angle a lot, but since it''s not centered, the centered text makes it look ... disjointed?  Centered often isn''t as interesting, but it would work well for this symmetrical view, so try to make it really centered. Also, try a more interesting font. I missed this in voting, but would''ve given it a 6.  With the changes above, maybe higher. :)', '2006-11-27 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065504, 428113, 60862, '<td valign="top">This was a fun idea! :)  Nice colors on the birds, too.</td>', 'This was a fun idea! :)  Nice colors on the birds, too.', '2006-11-27 10:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065510, 429150, 3214, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, love the silhouetted people.  It''s an unusual aspect ratio for a postcard!  Love the stacked and vertical text, too.</td>', 'Sweet shot, love the silhouetted people.  It''s an unusual aspect ratio for a postcard!  Love the stacked and vertical text, too.', '2006-11-27 10:26:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065511, 428633, 64571, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for all of the nice comments and the votes!<br/> <br/>Now, if I can learn how to add text and borders to photos, I''ll post higher scores in the future???!!</td>', 'Thanks so much for all of the nice comments and the votes! Now, if I can learn how to add text and borders to photos, I''ll post higher scores in the future???!!', '2006-11-27 10:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065514, 427919, 60862, '<td valign="top">This definitely feels like a touristy postcard. :)  I think it lacks some "pop," and I''m not sure what to suggest.  Either way, though, a fine entry.</td>', 'This definitely feels like a touristy postcard. :)  I think it lacks some "pop," and I''m not sure what to suggest.  Either way, though, a fine entry.', '2006-11-27 10:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065522, 427657, 3214, '<td valign="top">Love the originality, and it''s the kind of postcard I would send.</td>', 'Love the originality, and it''s the kind of postcard I would send.', '2006-11-27 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065524, 428106, 64571, '<td valign="top">Awesome finish - congrats!!!!</td>', 'Awesome finish - congrats!!!!', '2006-11-27 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065530, 429337, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot (which is why I have my own fogbound boat shot in my portfolio).  The text is hard to read, as others have noted, but to me what made me vote 5 vs. higher is the orientation.<br/> <br/>Fog seems to me to be about isolation.  No one expects there to be anything else far above the water, so what really drives home that point is to show nothing else ON the water.  If you have the room, try a landscape crop to see how it looks.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot (which is why I have my own fogbound boat shot in my portfolio).  The text is hard to read, as others have noted, but to me what made me vote 5 vs. higher is the orientation. Fog seems to me to be about isolation.  No one expects there to be anything else far above the water, so what really drives home that point is to show nothing else ON the water.  If you have the room, try a landscape crop to see how it looks.', '2006-11-27 10:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065531, 429277, 67626, '<td valign="top">congratulations! Beautiful shot...</td>', 'congratulations! Beautiful shot...', '2006-11-27 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065533, 429337, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice going. I''m not sure it would attract much attention on the postcard rack, but it''s a very nice image. BTW what''s a high pass layer?</td>', 'Nice going. I''m not sure it would attract much attention on the postcard rack, but it''s a very nice image. BTW what''s a high pass layer?', '2006-11-27 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065537, 429212, 64446, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. I like angle from the ground - it gives a feeling of "grandeur" to the building and the whole image.<br/>If any suggestion, it would be playing with the settings to minimize the lighting from center door and top right window.</td>', 'Excellent composition. I like angle from the ground - it gives a feeling of "grandeur" to the building and the whole image.If any suggestion, it would be playing with the settings to minimize the lighting from center door and top right window.', '2006-11-27 10:34:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065539, 428358, 64571, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t score higher!!!!!!!!!  I think it is great!</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t score higher!!!!!!!!!  I think it is great!', '2006-11-27 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065545, 429260, 21862, '<td valign="top">I think this makes a GREAT postcard, actually.</td>', 'I think this makes a GREAT postcard, actually.', '2006-11-27 10:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065548, 429340, 60862, '<td valign="top">I agree with what the other commenters said.  Try toning it down quite a bit to see what you get.  Look at the other shots in this challenge that use lights reflecting on water as models.</td>', 'I agree with what the other commenters said.  Try toning it down quite a bit to see what you get.  Look at the other shots in this challenge that use lights reflecting on water as models.', '2006-11-27 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065558, 429438, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lots to like about this shot - the diagonal, the equal emphasis on the cool-looking benches and Manhattan, and the processing.<br/> <br/>I''d suggest moving "New York" to the right side.  Above the buildings, the upper left corner ends up very dense while the upper right is empty.  To keep the text balanced, then I''d move the lower text over to the left.</td>', 'Lots to like about this shot - the diagonal, the equal emphasis on the cool-looking benches and Manhattan, and the processing. I''d suggest moving "New York" to the right side.  Above the buildings, the upper left corner ends up very dense while the upper right is empty.  To keep the text balanced, then I''d move the lower text over to the left.', '2006-11-27 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065565, 427805, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try reprocessing it with a little less sharpening and lot more contrast.  I bet you can get those clouds looking pretty dramatic.<br/> <br/>I like the trees framing the scene, but I agree that then the whole-frame border conflicts with them.</td>', 'Try reprocessing it with a little less sharpening and lot more contrast.  I bet you can get those clouds looking pretty dramatic. I like the trees framing the scene, but I agree that then the whole-frame border conflicts with them.', '2006-11-27 10:44:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065576, 429277, 51538, '<td valign="top">Now you''ll really have to find something else to shoot.  Any photos of the opera house are going to be downhill from now on ;-)  Congratulations!</td>', 'Now you''ll really have to find something else to shoot.  Any photos of the opera house are going to be downhill from now on ;-)  Congratulations!', '2006-11-27 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065578, 429256, 64446, '<td valign="top">I gave many 10''s in this challenge, but this one was my favorite.<br/>It is simply outstanding and makes one speachless. The sky and the colours are tremendous. And so are the lights - there not a gap from left to right.<br/>You should make it available for printing (both with and without the text).</td>', 'I gave many 10''s in this challenge, but this one was my favorite.It is simply outstanding and makes one speachless. The sky and the colours are tremendous. And so are the lights - there not a gap from left to right.You should make it available for printing (both with and without the text).', '2006-11-27 10:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
