(3065621, 429186, 35538, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I wish I would have had advanced editing rules...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=422184" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/422184.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/422184.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/422184.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Nice shot...I wish I would have had advanced editing rules...', '2006-11-27 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065623, 429237, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really liked this and scored accordingly - delighted to find it is one of the postcards I am to receive in the post for real!</td>', 'I really liked this and scored accordingly - delighted to find it is one of the postcards I am to receive in the post for real!', '2006-11-27 11:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065624, 427683, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10. I''ve been to Venice and this is even more beautiful than Venice! hahaha</td>', 'I gave this a 10. I''ve been to Venice and this is even more beautiful than Venice! hahaha', '2006-11-27 11:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065626, 429438, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal lines of the benches, the fence, and the river with the lights of the bridge scooping up on the far right. You captured the great attraction of the Brooklyn Promenade: the walk, the benches, and the expansive view of Manhattan.<br/> <br/>I like the text where it is. First of all, in the Western world, the eye reads from left to right and top to bottom. To reverse that would make the card a little uncomfortable. And second, the lower text is well situated on the promenade.</td>', 'I like the diagonal lines of the benches, the fence, and the river with the lights of the bridge scooping up on the far right. You captured the great attraction of the Brooklyn Promenade: the walk, the benches, and the expansive view of Manhattan. I like the text where it is. First of all, in the Western world, the eye reads from left to right and top to bottom. To reverse that would make the card a little uncomfortable. And second, the lower text is well situated on the promenade.', '2006-11-27 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065651, 429045, 37444, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image and am determined to learn this HDR thing :)</td>', 'I absolutely love this image and am determined to learn this HDR thing :)', '2006-11-27 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065655, 427805, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think this shot was under rated. I was one of the 6''s. I agree about the over sharpening. Maybe you should try ''smart sharpen'' if you are using CS2. That seems to create fewer, or less severe halos than USM. I like the concept of the transparent border, but on the bottom, it may be detracting from the feeling of distance to the castle. Maybe it would work better if it were the same width as the sides and top, or you might have to eliminate it all together. (You''d have to change the color of the text then.) I like your choice of font and the trees framing the shot.</td>', 'I think this shot was under rated. I was one of the 6''s. I agree about the over sharpening. Maybe you should try ''smart sharpen'' if you are using CS2. That seems to create fewer, or less severe halos than USM. I like the concept of the transparent border, but on the bottom, it may be detracting from the feeling of distance to the castle. Maybe it would work better if it were the same width as the sides and top, or you might have to eliminate it all together. (You''d have to change the color of the text then.) I like your choice of font and the trees framing the shot.', '2006-11-27 11:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065658, 429326, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful postcard Jorge.  Carry your camera outside more<br/>often.  It''s the only chance many will have to view Portugal.</td>', 'Beautiful postcard Jorge.  Carry your camera outside moreoften.  It''s the only chance many will have to view Portugal.', '2006-11-27 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3065664, 427243, 31403, '<td valign="top">another example of voters clubbing a photo because it doesn''t fit "their" idea of a postcard.<br/> <br/>Go make money with this - you''ll feel all kinds of better about this ridiculous score.<br/> <br/>:-)<br/> <br/>BTW, my scores didn''t end up counting since I didn''t vote on enough images - but I gave this a 7 - I think it''s a great shot and a product could be developed around it.</td>', 'another example of voters clubbing a photo because it doesn''t fit "their" idea of a postcard. Go make money with this - you''ll feel all kinds of better about this ridiculous score. :-) BTW, my scores didn''t end up counting since I didn''t vote on enough images - but I gave this a 7 - I think it''s a great shot and a product could be developed around it.', '2006-11-27 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
