(3065746, 428900, 32997, '<td valign="top">funny..this totally works yet lacks your artistic vision/interpretation...it is a fine shot in its own way, what is missing for me is the sense of your eye...and that is what personalizes the experience for me...<br/>of course this is simply because you are an <i>artist</i> much more than a <i>photographer</i> in my mind, and these comments are only about that..(but of course for this challenge none of my comments are relevant)<br/>-details are wonderful, tones are perfect...<br/>-can''t stand the font you used :)</td>', 'funny..this totally works yet lacks your artistic vision/interpretation...it is a fine shot in its own way, what is missing for me is the sense of your eye...and that is what personalizes the experience for me...of course this is simply because you are an artist much more than a photographer in my mind, and these comments are only about that..(but of course for this challenge none of my comments are relevant)-details are wonderful, tones are perfect...-can''t stand the font you used :)', '2006-11-27 12:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
