(3066287, 429294, 22301, '<td valign="top">Everytime I take a night shot for a challenge you leave me a comment on how this is good but up here in Iceland you need to bring something more to the photo because you are used to seeing Northern Lights and then you give me a 6, LOL. Now I see exactly what it means to take a night shot!!!! Congrats on the 8!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-30 04:52:51.</i></td>', 'Everytime I take a night shot for a challenge you leave me a comment on how this is good but up here in Iceland you need to bring something more to the photo because you are used to seeing Northern Lights and then you give me a 6, LOL. Now I see exactly what it means to take a night shot!!!! Congrats on the 8!', '2006-11-27 15:53:55.000000', '2006-11-30 04:52:51.000000', 0),
