(3066297, 429045, 22301, '<td valign="top">A great postcard, and wonderful subtle HDR work made this photo sing, and a monster score to boot, Congrats on the PB and a 7.75!</td>', 'A great postcard, and wonderful subtle HDR work made this photo sing, and a monster score to boot, Congrats on the PB and a 7.75!', '2006-11-27 15:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066303, 429018, 57260, '<td valign="top">Pity to see this entry so underrated (in my opinion). Someone mentioned the background not being inviting with the trash bin - I disagree. I think it''s perfect since it adds to the story and gives a sense of where this occurs (love CAN be found anywhere, even in the back streets next to the trash cans) and it also balances the composition nicely. I think it''s an incredible capture - Just not DPC friendly because there''s no dramatic storm clouds or clean studio lit set ups. Beautiful candids like this unfortunately do get underrated on DPC.</td>', 'Pity to see this entry so underrated (in my opinion). Someone mentioned the background not being inviting with the trash bin - I disagree. I think it''s perfect since it adds to the story and gives a sense of where this occurs (love CAN be found anywhere, even in the back streets next to the trash cans) and it also balances the composition nicely. I think it''s an incredible capture - Just not DPC friendly because there''s no dramatic storm clouds or clean studio lit set ups. Beautiful candids like this unfortunately do get underrated on DPC.', '2006-11-27 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066305, 429262, 22301, '<td valign="top">Wow, such a wonderful view and perspective, would be a great postcard, Congrats on that score, I know how you feel about the no honorable mention, but your shot is much better than mine :). Way to find the simple beauty in a complex structure.</td>', 'Wow, such a wonderful view and perspective, would be a great postcard, Congrats on that score, I know how you feel about the no honorable mention, but your shot is much better than mine :). Way to find the simple beauty in a complex structure.', '2006-11-27 16:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066310, 429326, 22301, '<td valign="top">Flawless light balance between the photo. Such great lines in the photo. Congrats on the 5th place!</td>', 'Flawless light balance between the photo. Such great lines in the photo. Congrats on the 5th place!', '2006-11-27 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066313, 428974, 22301, '<td valign="top">The fog makes this shot and really gives the photo a great mood, I could see this in any store.</td>', 'The fog makes this shot and really gives the photo a great mood, I could see this in any store.', '2006-11-27 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066315, 428113, 62095, '<td valign="top">Okay I figure I will give my thoughts on this in return for my postcard comments.  I reckon you got a fair score for this. I didn''t vote in Postcards, but probably would have voted this either 6 or 5.  I''m sure that the photo part of it is into 7 territory on its own, but the text is a bit distracting.  It looks like you''ve tried to echo the vibrant colours of the birds in the text, when what would probably have been easier on the eye is something more muted, or, like someone else mentioned, something overlaid on a corner of the photo. <br/> <br/>But if you followed my advice you''d have scored 4.3, so you did well ;)</td>', 'Okay I figure I will give my thoughts on this in return for my postcard comments.  I reckon you got a fair score for this. I didn''t vote in Postcards, but probably would have voted this either 6 or 5.  I''m sure that the photo part of it is into 7 territory on its own, but the text is a bit distracting.  It looks like you''ve tried to echo the vibrant colours of the birds in the text, when what would probably have been easier on the eye is something more muted, or, like someone else mentioned, something overlaid on a corner of the photo.  But if you followed my advice you''d have scored 4.3, so you did well ;)', '2006-11-27 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3066320, 429186, 22301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot. Tough break being 11th and also without a ribbon with a 7+ score. Perhaps a logo should be made for that club. :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I got a logo, come join us :). Seriously a great and well deserving 7 score. Congrats on the new Pb.</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: Great shot. Tough break being 11th and also without a ribbon with a 7+ score. Perhaps a logo should be made for that club. :P  I got a logo, come join us :). Seriously a great and well deserving 7 score. Congrats on the new Pb.', '2006-11-27 16:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
