(3067363, 429277, 23456, '<td valign="top">You are on fire Keith !! Keep taking those Sydney shots - you can''t LOSE !!! If you have the time you need to market this photo, publishers and tourism companies etc, it''s a winner. In fact you could put a nice little package of Sydney together and see what happens. They are magnificent photographs :-)<br/>-Lisa</td>', 'You are on fire Keith !! Keep taking those Sydney shots - you can''t LOSE !!! If you have the time you need to market this photo, publishers and tourism companies etc, it''s a winner. In fact you could put a nice little package of Sydney together and see what happens. They are magnificent photographs :-)-Lisa', '2006-11-27 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067424, 429045, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not that your score was lacking but I bet those hot spots kept this from scoring over an 8. Since the original didn''t have that problem you could have used a mask with a low opacity brush and "undo" the tone mapping a little bit in those hot spots or use the clone brush. Anyway, not that you need the help with this great result.</td>', 'Not that your score was lacking but I bet those hot spots kept this from scoring over an 8. Since the original didn''t have that problem you could have used a mask with a low opacity brush and "undo" the tone mapping a little bit in those hot spots or use the clone brush. Anyway, not that you need the help with this great result.', '2006-11-28 00:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
