(3069287, 429294, 55430, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2006-11-28 21:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069578, 429076, 31399, '<td valign="top">I think this shot looks "stealth"...now you figure out what I mean  by that cause I''m not sure even I know.  However, what I mean is that the shot has a FEEL to it..not really industrial, but cool like metal and blue ice and reminds me of aero materials, etc.  Nice idea and very non-typical of the large number of landscapes/cityscapes submitted in this challenge.  sentence comes to mind...your just that good! I LIKE the picture, a lot!</td>', 'I think this shot looks "stealth"...now you figure out what I mean  by that cause I''m not sure even I know.  However, what I mean is that the shot has a FEEL to it..not really industrial, but cool like metal and blue ice and reminds me of aero materials, etc.  Nice idea and very non-typical of the large number of landscapes/cityscapes submitted in this challenge.  sentence comes to mind...your just that good! I LIKE the picture, a lot!', '2006-11-28 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
