(3100154, 429439, 27735, '<td valign="top">I just came across Matt''s great photo from Free Study XV, with a similar view...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=433555" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/581/thumb/433555.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/581/thumb/433555.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/581/thumb/433555.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-08 14:24:40.</i></td>', 'I just came across Matt''s great photo from Free Study XV, with a similar view... ', '2006-12-08 14:22:56.000000', '2006-12-08 14:24:40.000000', 0),
(3101582, 428342, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well done Judi.  Very good technicals and aesthetics.  One small thing: do you think it''s tilted slightly left?  It looks that way to me, but of course it''s hard to tell without a horizon (but see the tree upper right).  I admit I''ve become obsessed with trying to make sure my photos are straight even when they don''t have a horizon--so much so I bought a level for my hotshoe.  And I know there can often be an illusion of tilt.  I wasn''t looking for it here, but I just got "that feeling". :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, that verbose para above is not supposed to detract from my original intent to give you kudos for such a fine shot here!</td>', 'Well done Judi.  Very good technicals and aesthetics.  One small thing: do you think it''s tilted slightly left?  It looks that way to me, but of course it''s hard to tell without a horizon (but see the tree upper right).  I admit I''ve become obsessed with trying to make sure my photos are straight even when they don''t have a horizon--so much so I bought a level for my hotshoe.  And I know there can often be an illusion of tilt.  I wasn''t looking for it here, but I just got "that feeling". :) Anyway, that verbose para above is not supposed to detract from my original intent to give you kudos for such a fine shot here!', '2006-12-09 01:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3101889, 429337, 65886, '<td valign="top">I love fog in photos snd the special mood it creates! too bad I didn''t vote in that challenge. I really like the dreamy and "human" mood the picture has - in opposite to often flat and smooth beauty of many postcards. I''d love to get a one like this some day:)</td>', 'I love fog in photos snd the special mood it creates! too bad I didn''t vote in that challenge. I really like the dreamy and "human" mood the picture has - in opposite to often flat and smooth beauty of many postcards. I''d love to get a one like this some day:)', '2006-12-09 08:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
