(3645284, 429364, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot of a beautiful place. With everything wet, the light and contrast is just outstanding. You seem to have the tricks for making skies just look like art works. The driveway certainly seems to be inviting the viewer up to the house.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot of a beautiful place. With everything wet, the light and contrast is just outstanding. You seem to have the tricks for making skies just look like art works. The driveway certainly seems to be inviting the viewer up to the house.', '2007-05-14 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
